text: ['Add {R} for each tapped land your opponents control.', 'Add {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}.', 'Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)\\nArtifact creature spells you cast have affinity for artifacts. (They cost {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)', 'Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)\\nFlying', "Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)\\nReturn target artifact to its owner's hand.", 'Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)\\nUntap all artifacts.', 'Armed Response deals damage to target attacking creature equal to the number of Equipment you control.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice any number of creatures.\\nTarget creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn for each creature sacrificed this way.', "At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, Skullcage deals 2 damage to that player unless they have exactly three or exactly four cards in hand.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, choose one —\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on target artifact creature.\\n• Put a charge counter on target noncreature artifact.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if Myr Servitor is on the battlefield, each player returns all cards named Myr Servitor from their graveyard to the battlefield.', "Attach target Equipment to target creature. (Control of the Equipment doesn't change.)", "Battered Golem doesn't untap during your untap step.\\nWhenever an artifact enters the battlefield, you may untap Battered Golem.", "Beacon of Destruction deals 5 damage to any target. Shuffle Beacon of Destruction into its owner's library.", 'Choose one —\\n• Change the text of target spell or permanent by replacing all instances of one basic land type with another. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)\\n• Change the text of target spell or permanent by replacing all instances of one color word with another. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)\\nEntwine {2} (Choose both if you pay the entwine cost.)', 'Choose one —\\n• Destroy target artifact.\\n• Destroy target land.\\nEntwine {3}{R} (Choose both if you pay the entwine cost.)', 'Choose one —\\n• Sacrifice any number of creatures. You gain 3 life for each sacrificed creature.\\n• Pay X life, then look at the top X cards of your library. Put one of those cards into your hand and exile the rest.\\nEntwine {B} (Choose both if you pay the entwine cost.)', 'Choose one —\\n• Untap all lands you control.\\n• Until end of turn, lands you control become 2/2 creatures that are still lands.\\nEntwine {2}{G} (Choose both if you pay the entwine cost.)', 'Choose one —\\n• You gain 5 life.\\n• Prevent the next 5 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn.\\nEntwine {2} (Choose both if you pay the entwine cost.)', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {X}. Scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'Counter target spell. If that spell is countered this way, its controller may put a creature card from their hand onto the battlefield.', "Create a 1/1 green Insect creature token for each Forest you control. Shuffle Beacon of Creation into its owner's library.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nRazorgrass Screen blocks each combat if able.", 'Destroy all creatures that dealt damage to you this turn.', 'Destroy each nonland artifact with mana value 4 or less.', 'Destroy target artifact. Scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'Destroy target blocking creature.', "Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated. You lose life equal to that creature's toughness.", 'Discard an artifact card: Fleshgrafter gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Door to Nothingness enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{W}{W}{U}{U}{B}{B}{R}{R}{G}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Door to Nothingness: Target player loses the game.', "Double target player's life total. Shuffle Beacon of Immortality into its owner's library.", 'Draw a card. Scry 2.', 'Each creature has "When this creature dies, choose target opponent. That player puts this card from its owner\'s graveyard onto the battlefield under their control at the beginning of the next end step."', 'Each player returns all artifact cards from their graveyard to the battlefield.', "Enchant artifact\\nEnchanted artifact can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.", 'Enchant artifact\\nEnchanted artifact has "At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice this artifact unless you pay its mana cost."', 'Enchant land\\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional two mana in any combination of colors.', 'Equipped creature gets +0/+2 and has "{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn."\\n{W}{W}: Attach Healer\'s Headdress to target creature you control.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0 for each artifact you control.\\n{B}{B}: Attach Cranial Plating to target creature you control.\\nEquip {1}', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+1 and has trample.\\n{G}{G}: Attach Horned Helm to target creature you control.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Equipped creature gets +3/+2.\\nWhenever Grafted Wargear becomes unattached from a permanent, sacrifice that permanent.\\nEquip {0} ({0}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Equipped creature has "{T}: Add one mana of any color."\\nEquip {1}', 'Equipped creature has first strike, trample, and haste.\\n{1}: If you control Equipment named Helm of Kaldra, Sword of Kaldra, and Shield of Kaldra, create Kaldra, a legendary 4/4 colorless Avatar creature token. Attach those Equipment to it.\\nEquip {2}', 'Equipped creature has first strike.\\n{R}{R}: Attach Sparring Collar to target creature you control.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', "Equipped creature has shroud. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\n{U}{U}: Attach Neurok Stealthsuit to target creature you control.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\\nWhenever a player casts a spell, sacrifice a creature.", 'Feedback Bolt deals damage to target player or planeswalker equal to the number of artifacts you control.', "Ferropede can't be blocked.\\nWhenever Ferropede deals combat damage to a player, you may remove a counter from target permanent.", 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Razormane Masticore unless you discard a card.\\nAt the beginning of your draw step, you may have Razormane Masticore deal 3 damage to target creature.', "First strike\\nGoblin Brawler can't be equipped.", 'Flash\\nSunburst (This enters the battlefield with a charge counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\nRemove a charge counter from Baton of Courage: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying, double strike', "Flying, vigilance (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach, and attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", 'Flying\\nEach creature you control is a Vampire in addition to its other creature types and has "Whenever this creature deals damage to a creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature."', "Flying\\nWhen Hoverguard Sweepers enters the battlefield, you may return up to two target creatures to their owners' hands.", 'Flying\\nWhenever a player casts a spell, you lose 1 life.', 'Flying\\n{R}: Furnace Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{T}: Attach target Equipment you control to target creature you control.', 'Flying\\n{T}: Target player loses 1 life.', "Flying\\n{U}: Advanced Hoverguard gains shroud until end of turn. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", "For each color, return up to one target card of that color from your graveyard to your hand. Exile All Suns' Dawn.", 'Guardian Idol enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}: Guardian Idol becomes a 2/2 Golem artifact creature until end of turn.', "Haste\\nIron-Barb Hellion can't block.", 'Haste\\n{T}: Vulshok Sorcerer deals 1 damage to any target.', 'If a player would draw a card, that player skips that draw instead.\\nAt the beginning of each end step, each player sacrifices a permanent unless they discard a card.', "Imprint — When Summoner's Egg enters the battlefield, you may exile a card from your hand face down.\\nWhen Summoner's Egg dies, turn the exiled card face up. If it's a creature card, put it onto the battlefield under your control.", 'Lands you control have "{T}: Add one mana of any color."', 'Magma Jet deals 2 damage to any target. Scry 2.', 'Modular—Sunburst (This creature enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it. When it dies, you may put its +1/+1 counters on target artifact creature.)', 'Nim Grotesque gets +1/+0 for each artifact you control.', 'No more than one creature can attack each combat.\\nNo more than one creature can block each combat.', "Plasma Elemental can't be blocked.", 'Players play with the top card of their libraries revealed.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Lantern of Insight: Target player shuffles.', 'Players skip their upkeep steps.', 'Protection from black and from red\\nWhenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may gain 1 life.', "Put target artifact or creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. Shuffle Beacon of Unrest into its owner's library.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Relentless Rats gets +1/+1 for each other creature on the battlefield named Relentless Rats.\\nA deck can have any number of cards named Relentless Rats.', 'Sacrifice Composite Golem: Add {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}.', 'Sacrifice an artifact: Add {C}{C}.', 'Sacrifice an artifact: Thermal Navigator gains flying until end of turn.', "Search target opponent's library for an artifact card and put that card onto the battlefield under your control. Then that player shuffles.", 'Search your library for an Equipment card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\nFlying', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Lunar Avenger: Lunar Avenger gains your choice of flying, first strike, or haste until end of turn.', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\nRemove two +1/+1 counters from Sawtooth Thresher: Sawtooth Thresher gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\nRemove two +1/+1 counters from Spinal Parasite: Remove a counter from target permanent.', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\n{1}, Remove four +1/+1 counters from Etched Oracle: Target player draws three cards.', "Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\n{4}, {T}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Suncrusher: Destroy target creature.\\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Suncrusher: Return Suncrusher to its owner's hand.", 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\n{T}: Double the number of +1/+1 counters on Solarion.', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a charge counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may gain life equal to the number of charge counters on Clearwater Goblet.', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a charge counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\nEquipped creature gets +X/+X, where X is the number of charge counters on Opaline Bracers.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a charge counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\nRemove a charge counter from Pentad Prism: Add one mana of any color.', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a charge counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\n{2}, Sacrifice Engineered Explosives: Destroy each nonland permanent with mana value equal to the number of charge counters on Engineered Explosives.', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a charge counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\n{2}, Sacrifice Heliophial: It deals damage equal to the number of charge counters on it to any target.', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a charge counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\n{T}, Remove X charge counters from Infused Arrows: Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn.', 'Tap two untapped artifacts you control: Untap target artifact.', 'Tap up to three target lands.', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn. Scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'Target creature gets +5/+0 and gains haste until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn. Scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose an artifact card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You may copy an instant or sorcery card in it. If you do, you may cast the copy without paying its mana cost.', 'Target player discards two cards. Scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', "Target player takes an extra turn after this one. Shuffle Beacon of Tomorrows into its owner's library.", "Trample, haste (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking. This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\\nAt the beginning of the end step, sacrifice Spark Elemental.", 'Trample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Cosmic Larva unless you sacrifice two lands.', 'Vigilance\\nAs long as Raksha Golden Cub is equipped, Cat creatures you control get +2/+2 and have double strike.', 'Vigilance\\n{W}: Loxodon Stalwart gets +0/+1 until end of turn.', 'When Anodet Lurker dies, you gain 3 life.', 'When Eternal Witness enters the battlefield, you may return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Leonin Squire enters the battlefield, return target artifact card with mana value 1 or less from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Magma Giant enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to each creature and each player.', "When Tornado Elemental enters the battlefield, it deals 6 damage to each creature with flying.\\nYou may have Tornado Elemental assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", 'When Trinket Mage enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an artifact card with mana value 1 or less, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When you control no other artifacts, sacrifice Synod Centurion.', 'Whenever Fangren Pathcutter attacks, attacking creatures gain trample until end of turn.', 'Whenever Tangle Asp blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.', 'Whenever a creature you control is dealt damage, put a +1/+1 counter on it. (It must survive the damage to get the counter.)', 'Whenever a player casts a spell, Blind Creeper gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever an artifact is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Moriok Rigger.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'You draw two cards and you lose 2 life.', 'You may cast spells as though they had flash.', 'You may choose not to untap Vedalken Shackles during your untap step.\\n{2}, {T}: Gain control of target creature with power less than or equal to the number of Islands you control for as long as Vedalken Shackles remains tapped.', 'You may pay {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} rather than pay the mana cost for spells you cast.', "You may pay {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nTrample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.", "You may pay {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nTrample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may draw two cards.", "You may pay {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nTrample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may pay 2 life. If you do, search your library for a card, then shuffle and put that card on top.", "You may pay {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nTrample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may return target artifact card from your graveyard to the battlefield.", "You may pay {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nTrample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may untap target creature and gain control of it until end of turn. That creature gains haste until end of turn.", 'You may play lands from your graveyard.', '{1}: Untap Staff of Domination.\\n{2}, {T}: You gain 1 life.\\n{3}, {T}: Untap target creature.\\n{4}, {T}: Tap target creature.\\n{5}, {T}: Draw a card.', '{1}{G}: Tyrranax gets -1/+1 until end of turn.', '{1}{R}, Remove a +1/+1 counter or a charge counter from a permanent you control: Ion Storm deals 2 damage to any target.', '{1}{W}: Return target artifact card with mana value 1 or less from your graveyard to your hand.', "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Wayfarer's Bauble: Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.", '{2}: Goblin Cannon deals 1 damage to any target. Sacrifice Goblin Cannon.', '{2}: Put a charge counter on Gemstone Array.\\nRemove a charge counter from Gemstone Array: Add one mana of any color.', '{2}: The next time an artifact source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{2}{G}, Sacrifice Viridian Scout: It deals 2 damage to target creature with flying.', '{3}, {T}: Double the amount of each type of unspent mana you have.', "{3}: Ensouled Scimitar becomes a 1/5 Spirit artifact creature with flying until end of turn. (Equipment that's a creature can't equip a creature.)\\nEquipped creature gets +1/+5.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "{3}: Switch Myr Quadropod's power and toughness until end of turn.", '{3}{G}, {T}: Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of artifacts your opponents control.', '{5}: Exchange control of Avarice Totem and target nonland permanent.', "{G}, Sacrifice Ouphe Vandals: Counter target activated ability from an artifact source and destroy that artifact if it's on the battlefield. (Mana abilities can't be targeted.)", '{G}, {T}, Sacrifice a Forest: Regenerate target creature.', "{R}, Sacrifice an artifact: Target creature can't block this turn.", '{R}, Sacrifice two artifacts: Destroy target artifact.', "{T}, Sacrifice Conjurer's Bauble: Put up to one target card from your graveyard on the bottom of your library. Draw a card.", '{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Blasting Station deals 1 damage to any target.\\nWhenever a creature enters the battlefield, you may untap Blasting Station.', '{T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Target player mills three cards.\\nWhenever an artifact enters the battlefield, you may untap Grinding Station.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color that a land an opponent controls could produce.', '{T}: Create a 2/2 colorless Pincher creature token.\\nWhenever an artifact is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may untap Summoning Station.', '{T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', '{T}: Prevent the next 2 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', '{T}: Return target noncreature artifact card with mana value 1 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nWhenever a creature dies, you may untap Salvaging Station.', '{T}: Tap target artifact.', '{U}, Discard an artifact card: Search your library for an artifact card with mana value 1 or less, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "{U}, {T}: Return target permanent you control to its owner's hand.", '{X}{1}: Chimeric Coils becomes an X/X Construct artifact creature. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.']
flavor: ['"All beings have an inner light. Let me show you yours."\\n—Ushanti, leonin seer', '"All memory of your existence will be wiped from reality. You will die, and no one will mourn."\\n—Memnarch', '"Feel the burn of the mists. Master them. They will devour your enemies."\\n—Geth, keeper of the Vault', '"Her will shall banish the shadows. Her might shall punish the lawless. Her beauty shall restore the light."\\n—Ushanti, leonin seer', '"I have no fangs, yet I constantly bite. I have no scales, yet I slither through you. What am I?"\\n—Riddle of the viper\'s venom', '"I may be kha, but without my soldiers, my people, I am nothing."\\n—Raksha Golden Cub', '"I watched a ship sail right through it. I thought it was harmless . . . until I saw what it had done to the crew."\\n—Bruenna, Neurok leader', '"If what I have seen comes to pass, we will need our guardians more than ever."\\n—Ushanti, leonin seer', '"It is all in my grasp. Every petty dream, every grand scheme, every soul, every fear. It all flows through me and from me."\\n—Memnarch', '"Like dawn\'s first light, blind the unprepared and banish the shadows."\\n—Skyhunter creed', '"Memnarch or the vedalken salvage most of the large machines, leaving us only scraps. Scraps are enough."', '"Memnarch shall rage against us. We shall endure."', '"Perhaps I should take Mirrodin apart and begin again."\\n—Memnarch', '"The Tangle loans you life. Spend it well."', '"They are like their vedalken masters: untouchable, aloof, and omnipresent."\\n—Bruenna, Neurok leader', '"Tracking a fangren pack is easy. Catching up to one is fatal."\\n—Viridian scout', '"We order them to stand, they stand. We order them to wait, they wait. We order them to die, they die."\\n—Pontifex, elder researcher', '"Well, I jammed the whatsit into the whackdoodle, but I think I broke the thingamajigger."', '"Why learn hundreds of spells when you can learn only one and use it to steal hundreds?"', '"Yesterday\'s relics will determine the outcome of tomorrow\'s war."\\n—Ushanti, leonin seer', "A chorus of life heralds the arrival of Mirrodin's final sun.", 'A dent marks every year of service, and it has as much rust as glory.', 'A small band of elves pledged many years ago to avoid the Edges of Forgetting. They have remained hidden until now.', 'A talented apprentice makes all things. The master makes all things possible.', 'A vertical scream pierces the night air and echoes doom through the clouds.', 'All the junk, refuse, and offal of the Krark Clan is diligently collected, melted down, and made into more junk, refuse, and offal.', 'Amidst the darkest ashes grow the strongest seeds.', 'Among the Vulshok, the most prized blades are those that killed their original owners.', "Any creature on a druid's shoulder is his family, any land under his feet his home.", 'As the dawns break, the manta soars.', 'As the fifth sun joins the other four, new abilities awaken in the creatures of Mirrodin.', "Baby dragons can't figure out humans—if they didn't want to be killed, why were they made of meat and treasure?", 'Each eye sees a different possibility for tomorrow.', 'Each generation, a handful of Auriok girls are allowed to visit the Cave of Light. They return riding the wind and brandishing steel.', 'Each myr was designed to fill a specific role. This one, for example, was designed to stomp on other myr.', "Even the clouds bend themselves to Memnarch's will, eager to swallow those who oppose him.", 'Every scar is a lesson, every battle a test of what you have learned.', 'For millennia they wandered from plane to plane, devouring all metal. Finally, their wanderings are over.', 'Goblin cannon crews are known not for their aim but for their ability to dive for cover.', 'Hand-stitched, and marked by the blood of the Auriok.', "He's got an axe to grind.", 'In the swirling mists, you could walk right up to one and not know until its teeth are in your throat.', 'It binds the five suns in human form.', "It follows the green sun over Mirrodin's surface, spinning massive webs of whispersilk as it goes.", "It is telling of the vedalkens' culture that they trust human couriers more than their own comrades.", 'It is the forest beyond the horizon, the mountain waiting to be climbed, the new land across the endless sea.', 'It is the moment of discovery, the triumph of the mind, the reimagining of past glory.', 'It outnumbers you one to many.', 'It shuns everything except its next meal.', 'It takes off with a roar of superheated wind, startling wild pterons as they survey the ground below.', 'Its laughter drives needles through your mind.', 'Its open mouth is a furnace blast that blisters the skin. Its smoking fists are meteors that split the earth.', 'Its power source is time itself. It absorbs unused minutes and hours, bringing the end of existence always closer.', 'Its precious corpses dance like puppets to attract mindless nim prey.', 'Its transmissions are the word of Memnarch. It speaks, and metal bows.', 'Long ago, the Auriok attempted peace with the loxodons. The leonin attempted war. Neither succeeded.', "Necrogen enflames certain emotional centers in the Morioks' brains: hate, aggression, and especially greed.", 'On Mirrodin, mages who call upon the power of rust are shunned by their people and often turn mercenary to survive.', 'Only Sylvok magic could truly capture the perfection of a Mirrodin sunrise.', 'Only a focused mind can survive it.', "Outside, it reflects the suns' light. Inside, it harvests the suns' power.", "Perhaps he shuns technology. Perhaps he appreciates nature. Perhaps he doesn't know the difference.", 'Power begets power.', 'Raksha watched as the goblins continued to pour onto the Razor Fields. "They just don\'t know when to stop, do they?"', 'Scholars say that arbiters exist on every world, created by an unknown hand to enforce justice.', "She remembers every word spoken, from the hero's oath to the baby's cry.", 'Some believe that Raksha, youngest of the kha, is the reincarnation of Dakan, the first and mightiest of leonin leaders.', 'Some blades seek their own wielders.', 'Sometimes "innovation" means "stealing another\'s secret before anyone else can."', 'Souls and steel, the essence of Mirrodin. Memnarch lacks one but has an abundance of the other.', 'The Auriok learned perseverance from their forebears. They learned justice from the leonin.', "The Great Furnace's blessing is a spectacular sight, but the best view comes at a high cost.", "The Krark Clan believes it's caught an ogre. The ogre believes he's caught seven goblins.", 'The Krark Clan enjoys pulling them apart just to watch them reassemble one another.', 'The Moriok call the black moon the Whisperer. At her apex, she whispers of power.', 'The Moriok scavenge for weapons, for armor, for food—and ultimately for their souls.', 'The Quicksilver Sea hissed and bubbled at the indignity. The Vulshok shaman just smiled.', 'The cave floods with light. A thousand rays shine forth and meld into one.', "The cube's surface is pockmarked with jagged runes that seem to shift when unobserved.", 'The deadliest killers serve only those who are not afraid to die.', 'The energy that infuses the rings with life also melts them away, leaving only useless puddles of slag.', 'The loxodon ascribe religious superiority to those born albino, believing them to be spiritually pure.', 'The model incorporated the fifth sun effortlessly, as if it had always known.', 'The necrogen may have taken its sight, but it can still taste the fear of its prey.', 'The ouphes finally managed to still the clockwork monstrosity by catching themselves in its cogs.', 'The path of least resistance is often through your enemies.', 'The vedalken see other beings from a cold distance, as either experimental subjects or objects of study.', "There aren't *that* many ways to destroy a solid steel weapon, but somehow the goblins keep finding new ones.", 'These machines build fearsome visages out of scrap metal to scare off predators who would otherwise be eager to consume them.', "They know a hoverguard's only blind spot is directly above it.", 'They only appear in emergencies, and emergencies never last long.', "Those near the clock don't hear it anymore, but their every movement is in time with its ticking.", "Those who find death under the black sun's shadow cannot escape its pull.", 'Though the grip of a golem is strong, the grip of Auriok magic is far stronger.', 'To look into its light is to meet the gaze of history.', 'To some the birth of the fifth sun was a sign of doom. To others it was a sign of salvation. But to all it was a sign.', 'Under its mists, the earth sleeps.', 'Vedalken weapons sold to outsiders are as dependable as the vedalken themselves.', 'Victims are lucky if they remember ever having had what was lost.', 'Vulshok shamans summon spark elementals to burn paths through thick underbrush—or through goblin salvage squads.', 'Vulshok sorcerers train by leaping into electrified storm clouds. Dead or alive, they come back down with smiles on their faces.', 'When enough artifacts lie too long in the same place, their magical radiation weakens reality, opening rifts of unpredictable destructive power.', 'When you feel a rumble in the ground, hold perfectly still. One sound will bring the hellion.', "Æther portals drift across Mirrodin's surface, dragging creatures across time and space."]
artist: ['Adam Rex', 'Alan Pollack', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Arnie Swekel', 'Ben Thompson', 'Brian Snõddy', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Christopher Rush', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'Dany Orizio', 'Daren Bader', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Dorman', 'David Martin', 'Donato Giancola', 'Doug Chaffee', 'Edward P. Beard, Jr.', 'Francis Tsai', 'Glen Angus', 'Greg Hildebrandt', 'Greg Staples', 'Heather Hudson', 'Ittoku', 'Jeff Easley', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jim Murray', 'Jim Nelson', 'John Avon', 'John Matson', 'Justin Sweet', 'Kev Walker', 'Luca Zontini', 'Mark A. Nelson', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Thompson', 'Matthew D. Wilson', 'Michael Sutfin', 'Nottsuo', 'Paolo Parente', 'Pete Venters', 'Puddnhead', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ron Spears', 'Ron Spencer', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Stephen Tappin', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Tim Hildebrandt', 'Tomas Giorello', 'Tony Szczudlo', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Wayne England', 'rk post']
