rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can target a tapped artifact.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': "Fist of Suns\'s ability is an alternative cost to cast a spell. You can\'t combine this with other alternative costs, such as flashback. You can pay additional costs, such as kicker, in addition to this alternative cost."}, {\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': "If you apply Fist of Suns\'s alternative cost to a spell with {X} in its mana cost, X is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell for which mana of any color can be spent to cast it, you may cast it for Fist of Suns\'s alternative cost and still spend any color of mana to cover that cost."}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': \'If you pay {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} rather than pay the mana cost of a spell with {X} in its mana cost, the only legal choice for X is 0.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': "If your Grafted Wargear somehow ends up on an opponent\'s creature and it then becomes unattached from that creature, you won\'t be able to sacrifice that creature because you don\'t control it."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "You may activate this card\'s equip ability targeting the creature that it is currently attached to, even if it\'s the only creature you control. Since the equip ability costs zero, you can do this as many times as you like during your main phases, though it generally won\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Grafted Wargear becomes unattached from the creature it\'s equipping if you equip it to a new creature, if Grafted Wargear leaves the battlefield, if the equipped creature ceases to be a creature, or if Grafted Wargear ceases to be an Equipment. (It also becomes unattached if the equipped creature leaves the battlefield, but the triggered ability won\'t do anything in that case.)"}]', "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'All Suns’ Dawn can have from zero to five targets, one for each color.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can target two blue-and-white multicolored cards by choosing one as the blue card and one as the white card.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You choose the color each target must be when you choose it as a target, so if the card you targeted as a blue card is red when All Suns’ Dawn resolves, the card is an illegal target, even if the spell doesn’t target another red card.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Any permanent is a legal target for Ferropede’s last ability, not just one with a counter on it.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If there’s more than one type of counter on the targeted permanent, Ferropede’s controller chooses which counter to remove from it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Any permanent is a legal target for Spinal Parasite’s ability, not just one with a counter on it. The player who controls Spinal Parasite chooses which counter to remove from the targeted permanent.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If Spinal Parasite is a 1/1 because it has two +1/+1 counters on it, you can remove both counters to pay for its activated ability.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Yes, this card’s base power/toughness is -1/-1. If it has five +1/+1 counters on it, it’s a 4/4 creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Any restrictions on the mana in your mana pool aren’t copied. For example, if you have {C}{W}{W}{B} with no restrictions on it in your mana pool and {U}{U}{U} that can be used only to cast artifact spells, you’ll end up with {C}{C}{W}{W}{W}{W}{B}{B}, {U}{U}{U} that can be used only to cast artifact spells, and {U}{U}{U} that can be used for anything.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Doubling Cube’s ability is a mana ability.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The “type” of mana is its color, or lack thereof (if the mana is colorless).'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Any triggered abilities that triggered during the untap step will go onto the stack at the start of the draw step.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The upkeep step is skipped entirely. The turn proceeds from untap step to draw step.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Upkeep-triggered abilities don’t trigger, and “activate this ability only during your upkeep” abilities can’t be activated.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Any “When this creature is turned face up” abilities that the exiled card may have don’t trigger because the card isn’t being turned face up while it’s on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If the card is not a creature card when it’s turned face up, it remains exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The card is imprinted face down. This means that other players don’t know what the card is and you can’t look at the card once it’s imprinted (until it’s turned face up, of course). Note that effects that exile cards, including all previous imprint cards, exile those cards face up unless the effect says otherwise.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Assuming the entwine cost has been paid, the effect is (1) sacrifice any number of creatures, (2) gain 3 life for each sacrificed creature, (3) choose X, (4) pay X life, and (5) look at the top X cards of your library, put one into your hand, and exile the rest.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Everything other than the mode/entwine choice (and paying the {1}{B}, of course) is done on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Blinkmoth Infusion untaps all artifacts on the battlefield, not just artifacts you control.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If you control no artifacts, Blinkmoth Infusion costs twelve generic mana and two blue mana to cast.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Each land you control gets this ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'For the leaves-the-battlefield ability, the number of counters on Arcbound Wanderer at the time it left the battlefield is what’s relevant; the number of colors of mana used to pay its cost doesn’t matter anymore.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'This card has modular—sunburst, a combination of two keyword abilities. The sunburst ability sets the number for the modular ability. Basically, the number of +1/+1 counters the Wanderer gets as it enters the battlefield is equal to the number of colors of mana used to pay its cost.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'When the Wanderer leaves the battlefield, you may put the counters onto a single target artifact creature. You can’t split them among two or more artifact creatures.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If this creature gets enough -1/-1 counters put on it to cause its toughness to be 0 or less (or the damage marked on it to be lethal), modular will put a number of +1/+1 counters on the target artifact creature equal to the number of +1/+1 counters on this creature before it left the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Gaining life when a creature enters the battlefield is optional.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Helm of Kaldra is the third card in the Kaldra cycle. Sword of Kaldra was in the Mirrodin set. Shield of Kaldra was in the Darksteel set.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The token is named Kaldra, has the supertype legendary, and has creature type Avatar.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The token isn’t put onto the battlefield unless you control all three Equipment when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If Desecration Elemental is the only creature you control when its triggered ability resolves, you’ll have to sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'This ability triggers off anyone casting a spell, including you, not just Desecration Elemental’s controller or an opponent.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If Mycosynth Golem is sacrificed as part of the cost to cast a spell, the cost reduction will already be locked in, and the cost won’t be increased.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The spells gain affinity for artifacts as they’re put onto the stack. They don’t have the ability while they’re cards in your hand.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Two or more instances of the affinity ability are cumulative, even if they’re both affinity for the same thing.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If Vedalken Shackles becomes untapped before its ability resolves, you won’t gain control of the creature.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If Vedalken Shackles leaves the battlefield, it’s no longer tapped, so the control-changing effect ends.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The creature’s power and the number of Islands you control matter only when the ability is activated and when it resolves. After that, only the fact that Vedalken Shackles remains tapped matters. If the creature stops being a creature, you’ll keep control of it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If X is 0, Chimeric Coils becomes a 0/0 creature and is put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If the copied card is a split card, you may choose to cast either side of the split card but not both.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If you don’t want to cast the copy, you can choose not to; the copy ceases to exist the next time state-based actions are checked.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Reversal of Fortune creates a copy of the card in the other player’s hand, then allows you to cast the copy from that player’s hand without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The spell is cast from your opponent’s hand, not yours, which can be important for some cards.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can’t cast the copy if an effect prevents you from casting instants or sorceries, or from casting that particular instant or sorcery. It doesn’t matter whether your opponent can cast the card at this time; the only thing that matters is whether you can cast it.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can’t cast the copy unless all of its targets, if any, can be chosen.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You cast the copy while this ability is resolving and still on the stack. Normally, you’re not allowed to cast spells or activate abilities at this time. Reversal of Fortune provides an exception.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You don’t pay the spell’s mana cost. If the spell has X in its mana cost, X is 0. You do pay any additional costs for that spell. You can’t use any alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2005-03-01', 'text': 'The creation of the copy and then the casting of the copy are both optional.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If the creature is dealt damage by more than one source at the same time, it gets only one counter.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The creature doesn’t get a counter if all the damage that would be dealt to it is prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If the enchanted artifact has X in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Mana cost includes any requirements for colored mana, although most artifacts don’t have any color requirements.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If the spell isn’t countered (because it’s a spell that can’t be countered, for example), nothing happens.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If your Fold into Aether counters a spell you control, you get to put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'It is possible to activate this ability in response to itself and generate some odd combinations. For example, if you control this card and another permanent, you can use this card’s ability and target the permanent you control. You can then use this card’s ability again and target a permanent your opponent controls. The second usage resolves first and you get your opponent’s permanent in exchange for this one. The first usage then resolves and swaps your other permanent for the Totem so you get it back. The net effect is that you can swap any non-land permanent you have for any of theirs if you can activate this ability twice. Note that your opponent does get the chance to use the Totem in between the resolutions of your two usages if they have the mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Magnetic Theft can cause an Equipment one player controls to be attached to a creature another player controls. The controller of the Equipment can pay the equip cost to move the Equipment to a creature they control (but only any time that player could cast a sorcery).'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Raksha Golden Cub is a Cat, so it also gets +2/+2 and double strike if it’s equipped.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Skullcage doesn’t check hand size when it triggers, only when it resolves.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Skullcage’s ability deals damage if the player has zero, one, two, five, or more than five cards in hand when its ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The ability targets an ability on the stack, not the artifact, so it can destroy an artifact with protection from green or one that can’t be targeted by spells and abilities.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The controller of Vedalken Orrery can cast nonland artifact, creature, enchantment, and sorcery cards any time they could cast an instant. This includes on other players’ turns and during the upkeep step, draw step, combat phase, and end step.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'This applies only to casting spells. It does not, for example, change when you may activate abilities that can only be activated “any time you could cast a sorcery”.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The controller of the land gets the additional mana, not the controller of the enchantment.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The two mana can be of two different colors. The controller of the land chooses the colors.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The creatures have the triggered ability, so each creature’s controller chooses one of their opponents to target.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The triggered ability Mephidross Vampire grants to each creature you control triggers on any damage dealt to any creature, not just combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'This ability triggers off anyone casting a spell, including you, not just Blind Creeper’s controller or an opponent.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'This ability triggers off anyone casting a spell, including you, not just Ebon Drake’s controller or an opponent.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can activate Goblin Cannon’s ability multiple times in response to the first activation. Goblin Cannon will be sacrificed the first time the ability resolves, but each activation still deals damage when it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can activate an equip ability that targets Goblin Brawler, but the Equipment will fail to move onto it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You choose whether Lunar Avenger gains flying, first strike, or haste when the activated ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You do the scrying at the end of the ability’s resolution (assuming you pay {1}).'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': '“Double” has its normal English meaning. If Solarion had three +1/+1 counters on it, it would end up with six +1/+1 counters on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-04-01', 'text': 'Because of updated targeting rulings, it’s possible to target the same spell or permanent with both abilities when cast with Entwine.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'If you double a negative life total, you do the real math. A life total of -10 becomes -20.'}, {'date': '2007-07-15', 'text': 'Beacon of Immortality’s effect counts as life gain (or life loss, if the life total was negative) for effects that trigger on or replace life gain (or life loss).'}, {'date': '2007-07-15', 'text': 'If a Beacon is countered or doesn’t resolve, it’s put into its owner’s graveyard, not shuffled into the library.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-07-15', 'text': 'If a Beacon is countered or doesn’t resolve, it’s put into its owner’s graveyard, not shuffled into the library.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Lands that enter the battlefield or otehrwise come under your control after Rude Awakening resolves won’t be affected.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Activating the last ability of Guardian Idol while it’s already a creature will override any effects that set its power or toughness to a specific value. Effects that modify power or toughness without setting them to a specific value will continue to apply.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Guardian Idol has any +1/+1 counters on it, those counters will remain on it after it stops being a creature. Those counters will have no effect as long as Guardian Idol isn’t a creature, but they will apply again if it later becomes a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Effects that switch power and toughness apply after all other effects that change power and/or toughness, regardless of which effect was created first.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Switching a creature’s power and toughness twice (or any even number of times) effectively returns the creature to the power and toughness it had before any switches.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes while you’re casting a spell or activating an ability, the new top card won’t be revealed until you finish casting that spell or activating that ability.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The top card of your library isn’t in your hand, so you can’t suspend it, cycle it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When playing with the top card of your library revealed, if an effect tells you to draw several cards, reveal each one before you draw it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You must be able to target another spell to cast Condescend. Condescend can’t target itself.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You scry 2 even if the spell’s controller pays {X}.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If blocked by a creature with banding, the defending player decides whether or not the damage is assigned “as though it weren’t blocked”.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'When assigning combat damage, you choose whether you want to assign all damage to blocking creatures, or if you want to assign all of it to the player or planeswalker this creature is attacking. You can’t split the damage assignment between them.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can decide to assign damage to the defending player or planeswalker even if the blocking creature has protection from green or damage preventing effects on it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Crucible of Worlds doesn\'t allow you to activate abilities (such as cycling) of land cards in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Crucible of Worlds doesn\'t change the times when you can play those land cards. You can still play only one land per turn, and only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The Myr Servitor that’s the source of the triggered ability must still be on the battlefield when the ability resolves. If it is, all other Myr Servitor cards are returned from all graveyards to the battlefield under their owner’s control. If it’s not, no Myr Servitors are returned to the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Colorless mana won\'t give Engineered Explosives another charge counter. Colorless is not a color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Tokens that aren\'t a copy of something else don\'t have a mana cost. Anything without a mana cost normally has a mana value of 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can choose any value for X as you cast Engineered Explosives. The value chosen for X doesn\'t directly affect the number of charge counters Engineered Explosives enters the battlefield with, but it does let you pay more mana and thus spend more colors of mana to cast it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If the target card is an illegal target by the time Beacon of Unrest tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t shuffle it into your library."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the permanent you control from Beacon of Unrest is exiled.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Once Pentad Prism has run out of charge counters, it remains on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Sunburst checks what mana was actually spent to cast the spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn\'t otherwise spend, but it doesn\'t change what mana you spent to cast the spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a resolving spell puts Eternal Witness onto the battlefield, Eternal Witness\'s ability can target that card if it\'s put into your graveyard as it resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to one Relentless Rats may become lethal if another Relentless Rats leaves the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'The last ability of Relentless Rats lets you ignore the "four-of" rule. It doesn\\\'t let you ignore format legality. For example, during a Time Spiral Remastered Limited event, you can\\\'t add Relentless Rats from your personal collection.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Cranial Plating is counted by its own ability, so it gives at least +1/+0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Cranial Plating\'s first activated ability is similar to an equip ability, but it\'s not an equip ability. Most importantly, it can be activated any time you could cast an instant, even during another player\'s turn."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abunas Gesang\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines Du erhältst 5 Lebenspunkte dazu; oder verhindere die nächsten 5 Schadenspunkte, die in diesem Zug einer Kreatur deiner Wahl zugefügt würden.\\nVerflechtung {2} (Bestimme beides, falls du die Verflechtungskosten bezahlst.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80877&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'014fb14a-7df3-4fe2-b3bd-93ac8bf568a3\', \'multiverseId\': 80877}, \'multiverseid\': 80877}, {\'name\': \'Canto del abunas\', \'text\': \'Elige uno: Gana 5 vidas; o prevén los siguientes 5 puntos de daño que se le fuera a hacer a la criatura objetivo este turno.\\nEntrelazar {2} (Si pagas el coste de entrelazar, juega ambas opciones.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e252aefe-7386-4e85-9b4b-9691550dcfbe\', \'multiverseId\': 81042}, \'multiverseid\': 81042}, {\'name\': "Chant de l\'abuna", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un — Vous gagnez 5 points de vie ; ou prévenez, ce tour-ci, les prochaines 5 blessures sur une créature ciblée.\\nUnion {2} (Choisissez les deux si vous payez le coût d\'union.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80712&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31202e2c-84bf-4bd4-b74e-6edaca413738\', \'multiverseId\': 80712}, \'multiverseid\': 80712}, {\'name\': "Canto dell\'Abuna", \'text\': \'Scegli una delle opzioni seguenti Guadagni 5 punti vita; oppure previeni i prossimi 5 danni che verrebbero inflitti a una creatura bersaglio in questo turno.\\nIntrecciare {2} (Scegli entrambe se paghi il costo di intrecciare.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bb0a7be-b9dd-487c-a7d9-6c70545c207d\', \'multiverseId\': 81207}, \'multiverseid\': 81207}, {\'name\': \'高僧の詠唱\', \'text\': \'以下の２つから１つを選ぶ。「あなたは５点のライフを得る。」「クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それに与えられる次のダメージを５点軽減する。」\\n双呪 {2} （双呪コストを支払った場合、両方を選ぶ。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0eb6820-1376-486c-ba7c-a81c9e29971c\', \'multiverseId\': 80547}, \'multiverseid\': 80547}, {\'name\': \'Canto do Abuna\', \'text\': \'Escolha um Você ganha 5 pontos de vida; ou previne os próximos 5 pontos de dano que seriam causados à criatura alvo neste turno.\\nEntrelaçar {2} (Escolha ambos se pagar o custo de entrelaçar.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7747a90e-8ef0-4ff7-9a8d-ae93a545c4d5\', \'multiverseId\': 81372}, \'multiverseid\': 81372}, {\'name\': \'高僧吟颂\', \'text\': \'选择一项～你获得5点生命；或防止本回合中接下来将对目标生物造成的5点伤害。\\n打包{2}（若你支付打包费用，则两项都选择。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95dbb035-8ac3-4a78-a81f-a65f2fbfc609\', \'multiverseId\': 81537}, \'multiverseid\': 81537}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akquirieren\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche die Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl nach einer Artefaktkarte und bringe diese Karte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Dieser Spieler mischt dann seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Manchmal bedeutet „Innovation", jemandem ein Geheimnis zu stehlen, bevor ein anderer die Möglichkeit dazu hat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80878&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c10c58-192f-4c0b-ad25-3e725f72e475\', \'multiverseId\': 80878}, \'multiverseid\': 80878}, {\'name\': \'Adquirir\', \'text\': \'Busca una carta de artefacto en la biblioteca del oponente objetivo y ponla en juego bajo tu control. Luego ese jugador baraja su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'A veces "innovar" significa "robar los secretos de otro antes que nadie".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8b1bd2c-a805-4ae5-a1d0-a687c551e921\', \'multiverseId\': 81043}, \'multiverseid\': 81043}, {\'name\': \'Acquisition\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans la bibliothèque de l\'adversaire ciblé une carte d\'artefact et mettez-la en jeu sous votre contrôle. Ce joueur mélange ensuite sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Parfois, « innover » signifie « être le premier à voler le secret d\'autrui. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80713&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7883f844-b421-4e38-801b-282fc2970785\', \'multiverseId\': 80713}, \'multiverseid\': 80713}, {\'name\': \'Acquisire\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il grimorio di un avversario bersaglio, scegli una carta artefatto e metti in gioco quella carta sotto il tuo controllo. Poi quel giocatore rimescola il proprio grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'A volte "innovazione" significa "rubare i segreti di una persona prima che ci riesca qualcun\\\'altro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac402339-7b9e-4cbf-8f8f-ff58dc4bd592\', \'multiverseId\': 81208}, \'multiverseid\': 81208}, {\'name\': \'接収\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーのライブラリーからアーティファクト・カードを１枚探し、あなたのコントロール下で場に出す。その後、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'時として「革新」とは、「他人の秘密を誰よりも先に盗むこと」を意味する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aec44775-b3d2-40ea-a373-9c1099d12b56\', \'multiverseId\': 80548}, \'multiverseid\': 80548}, {\'name\': \'Adquirir\', \'text\': \'Procure por um card de artefato no grimório do oponente alvo e coloque-o em jogo sob seu controle. Depois, aquele jogador embaralha seu próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Algumas vezes, "inovar" quer dizer "roubar o segredo de alguém antes que outro o faça".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0eedca7-49f7-440a-9991-c54cca6ca1c5\', \'multiverseId\': 81373}, \'multiverseid\': 81373}, {\'name\': \'掌握\', \'text\': \'从目标对手的牌库中搜寻一张神器牌，并将该牌在你的操控下放置进场。然后该牌手将其牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'有时「创新」意指「先一步偷取他人秘密」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ac0447-87fb-432e-8099-5ec249a618c2\', \'multiverseId\': 81538}, \'multiverseid\': 81538}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arachnoide\', \'text\': \'Der Arachnoide kann blocken, als ob er Flugfähigkeit hätte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Er folgt der grünen Sonne über Mirrodins Oberfläche und hinterlässt dicke Netze aus Flüsterseide als Spur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80882&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e82e4a6-4895-4442-8568-6ee22cb8a085\', \'multiverseId\': 80882}, \'multiverseid\': 80882}, {\'name\': \'Aracnoide\', \'text\': \'El Aracnoide puede bloquear como si tuviera la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'Sigue al sol verde sobre la superficie de Mirrodin, dejando enormes redes de sedasusurrante a su paso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4d8cb34-007f-4dcc-bb00-d9e00597bb19\', \'multiverseId\': 81047}, \'multiverseid\': 81047}, {\'name\': \'Arachnoïde\', \'text\': "L\'Arachnoïde peut bloquer comme si elle avait le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : araignée\', \'flavor\': "Elle suit le parcours du soleil vert à la surface de Mirrodin, tissant d\'immenses toiles de frémisoie sur son passage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80717&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21b77930-9b16-41dd-a6a8-e9fe9c7f9b09\', \'multiverseId\': 80717}, \'multiverseid\': 80717}, {\'name\': \'Aracnoide\', \'text\': "L\'Aracnoide può bloccare come se avesse volare.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'Segue sulla superficie di Mirrodin il corso del sole verde, tessendo imponenti ragnatele di Setabisbiglio lungo il proprio percorso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98ede9ac-45f3-4384-8783-1c8ae2dbeebc\', \'multiverseId\': 81212}, \'multiverseid\': 81212}, {\'name\': \'機械蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'機械蜘蛛は飛行を持っているかのようにブロックに参加してよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'それは巨大な囁き絹の巣を振り回し、ミラディンの地表で緑の太陽を追い続ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eff38954-acf6-4aa3-8f92-3b1b6cc13856\', \'multiverseId\': 80552}, \'multiverseid\': 80552}, {\'name\': \'Aracnóide\', \'text\': \'Aracnóide pode bloquear como se tivesse a habilidade de voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'Ela segue o sol verde por toda a superfície de Mirrodin, fiando imensas teias de seda ruflante conforme o acompanha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6af50012-4683-4dfe-8e54-bb79552304cc\', \'multiverseId\': 81377}, \'multiverseid\': 81377}, {\'name\': \'织网蛛\', \'text\': \'织网蛛可以视同具飞行异能地进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'它随着绿日于秘罗地地表出没，一路纺着巨大的细语丝网。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a194af4f-1bef-4f40-a710-3ac5a2856a9a\', \'multiverseId\': 81542}, \'multiverseid\': 81542}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufgang aller Sonnen\', \'text\': \'Bringe für jede Farbe bis zu einer Karte deiner Wahl dieser Farbe aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Entferne den Aufgang aller Sonnen dann ganz aus dem Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80880&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7b8cae1-4a38-43f1-bf9d-0420c86ec92b\', \'multiverseId\': 80880}, \'multiverseid\': 80880}, {\'name\': \'Amanecer de todos los soles\', \'text\': \'Por cada color, regresa hasta una carta objetivo de ese color de tu cementerio a tu mano. Luego remueve del juego el Amanecer de todos los soles.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09192df7-4bcb-40a1-82ea-3cf2eb7a6591\', \'multiverseId\': 81045}, \'multiverseid\': 81045}, {\'name\': "L\'aube de tous les soleils", \'text\': "Pour chaque couleur, renvoyez jusqu\'à une carte ciblée de cette couleur depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Retirez ensuite L\'aube de tous les soleils de la partie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80715&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'731d16f0-2876-4fc4-bb67-c307ca311ec2\', \'multiverseId\': 80715}, \'multiverseid\': 80715}, {\'name\': \'Alba di Tutti i Soli\', \'text\': "Per ogni colore, riprendi in mano fino a una carta bersaglio di quel colore dal tuo cimitero. Poi rimuovi dal gioco l\'Alba di Tutti i Soli.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ff3b6bb-e5cf-4fd9-98c5-04ae3aea129c\', \'multiverseId\': 81210}, \'multiverseid\': 81210}, {\'name\': \'全ての太陽の夜明け\', \'text\': \'各色１色につき、あなたの墓地にあるその色のカードを最大１枚まで対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。その後全ての太陽の夜明けをゲームから取り除く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f3692e0-49ef-4fb0-9997-90ab5ed98374\', \'multiverseId\': 80550}, \'multiverseid\': 80550}, {\'name\': \'Aurora de Todos os Sóis\', \'text\': \'Para cada cor, devolva até um card alvo daquela cor de seu cemitério para a sua mão. Depois, remova de jogo Aurora de Todos os Sóis.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa1e7f3c-7f0f-4c9e-a4e4-66f3574eabc9\', \'multiverseId\': 81375}, \'multiverseid\': 81375}, {\'name\': \'五色晨曦\', \'text\': \'为五种颜色各选择至多一张该色的目标牌，将这些牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。然后将五色晨曦移出对战。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fd903ee-2d3f-4fcf-8504-a8dec5acad2e\', \'multiverseId\': 81540}, \'multiverseid\': 81540}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufgeladene Pfeile\', \'text\': \'Sonneneruption (Diese Karte kommt für jede unterschiedliche Manafarbe, die beim Bezahlen ihrer Kosten verwendet wurde, mit einer Ladungsmarke ins Spiel.)\\n{T}, entferne X Ladungsmarken von den Aufgeladenen Pfeilen: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80955&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e60d335-a0b1-478d-880b-3b433d5ac62b\', \'multiverseId\': 80955}, \'multiverseid\': 80955}, {\'name\': \'Flechas imbuidas\', \'text\': \'Estallido solar (Esto entra en juego con un contador de carga sobre él por cada color de maná usado para pagar su coste.)\\n{T}, remover X contadores de carga de las Flechas imbuidas: La criatura objetivo obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd20c2a0-a5d1-4c43-bfec-559bd7edce57\', \'multiverseId\': 81120}, \'multiverseid\': 81120}, {\'name\': \'Flèches infusées\', \'text\': "Solarisation (Cette carte arrive en jeu avec, sur elle, un marqueur « charge » pour chaque couleur de mana utilisée pour payer son coût.)\\n{T}, Retirez X marqueurs « charge » des Flèches infusées : La créature ciblée gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80790&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b83179c4-490f-43ed-acb7-04644a2ffa1a\', \'multiverseId\': 80790}, \'multiverseid\': 80790}, {\'name\': \'Frecce Infuse\', \'text\': \'Solarizzazione (Questa carta entra in gioco con un segnalino carica per ogni colore di mana usato per pagare il suo costo.)\\n{T}, Rimuovi X segnalini carica dalle Frecce Infuse: La creatura bersaglio prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'501a9b61-53fb-4f0d-b718-ba442729fb7c\', \'multiverseId\': 81285}, \'multiverseid\': 81285}, {\'name\': \'注入の矢\', \'text\': \'烈日 （これのコストのために支払われたマナの色１色につき１個の蓄積カウンターが置かれた状態で場に出る。）\\n{T}, 注入の矢の上から蓄積カウンターをX個取り除く：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで-X/-Xの修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a6ff7ff-626d-4b8b-92a7-72cf7220f647\', \'multiverseId\': 80625}, \'multiverseid\': 80625}, {\'name\': \'Flechas Infundidas\', \'text\': \'Facho Solar (Este card entra em jogo com um marcador de carga para cada cor de mana usada para pagar seu custo.)\\n{T}, Remova X marcadores de carga de Flechas Infundidas: A criatura alvo recebe -X/-X até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e26cadb-50e2-4480-8619-597773540b3b\', \'multiverseId\': 81450}, \'multiverseid\': 81450}, {\'name\': \'蓄能箭\', \'text\': \'辉映（用过几种颜色的法术力来支付其费用，它进场时上面便有几个充电指示物。）\\n{T}，从蓄能箭上移去X个充电指示物：目标生物得-X/-X直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'365421ae-e28d-45d1-be55-2359ba5b94d5\', \'multiverseId\': 81615}, \'multiverseid\': 81615}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufgepfropfte Kriegsausrüstung\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+2.\\nImmer wenn die aufgepfropfte Kriegsausrüstung von einer Kreatur gelöst wird, opfere diese Kreatur.\\nAusrüsten {0}({0}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, an. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80946&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac254721-05dc-412b-bd65-871a10610f2b\', \'multiverseId\': 80946}, \'multiverseid\': 80946}, {\'name\': \'Equipo de guerra injertado\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+2.\\nSiempre que el Equipo de guerra injertado sea desanexado de una criatura, sacrifica esa criatura.\\nEquipar {0} ({0}: Anexa este equipo a la criatura objetivo que controles. Juega la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'815e06ae-761c-4275-9bd6-ca245ae539bd\', \'multiverseId\': 81111}, \'multiverseid\': 81111}, {\'name\': \'Harnais de guerre greffé\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +3/+2.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Harnais de guerre greffé devient détaché d\'une créature, sacrifiez cette créature.\\nÉquipement {0} ({0} : Attachez à la créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez jouer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80781&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4563b038-7aeb-4817-96a6-ae9e743787c7\', \'multiverseId\': 80781}, \'multiverseid\': 80781}, {\'name\': \'Arsenale Inciso\', \'text\': "La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+2.\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Arsenale Inciso viene tolto da una creatura, sacrifica quella creatura.\\nEquipaggiare {0} ({0}: Assegnalo a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggialo solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cdda50e-4727-4f89-ae1a-75dd21e5194b\', \'multiverseId\': 81276}, \'multiverseid\': 81276}, {\'name\': \'融合する武具\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは+3/+2の修整を受ける。\\n融合する武具がいずれかのクリーチャーからはずされた場合、そのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる。\\n装備 {0} （{0}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9243ee83-712b-470a-adda-3c16bde9517b\', \'multiverseId\': 80616}, \'multiverseid\': 80616}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de Guerra Enxertada\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +3/+2.\\nToda vez que Armadura de Guerra Enxertada for solta de uma criatura, sacrifique aquela criatura.\\nEquipar {0} ({0}: Anexe a uma criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente quando pudesse jogar um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99cf34e3-bec6-4c84-a337-1de2d9cbc5b2\', \'multiverseId\': 81441}, \'multiverseid\': 81441}, {\'name\': \'植髓战甲\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+3/+2。\\n每当植髓战甲从生物上卸装时，牺牲该生物。\\n佩带{0}（{0}：装备在目标由你操控的生物上；佩带的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b7da01c-8f40-4bee-b299-1762b911ce06\', \'multiverseId\': 81606}, \'multiverseid\': 81606}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufräumender Schwebgardist\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Aufräumende Schwebgardist ins Spiel kommt, kannst du bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurückschicken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Sie tauchen nur in Notlagen auf, und Notlagen dauern nie lange.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80954&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c6c2864-8f53-4506-a763-abe791487ae1\', \'multiverseId\': 80954}, \'multiverseid\': 80954}, {\'name\': \'Barredores aeroguarda\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando los Barredores aeroguarda entren en juego, puedes regresar hasta dos criaturas objetivo a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano\', \'flavor\': \'Sólo aparecen en caso de emergencia, y las emergencias nunca duran mucho.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a16bc56-5c46-48ee-80ed-7306f1e531cb\', \'multiverseId\': 81119}, \'multiverseid\': 81119}, {\'name\': \'Balayeurs aérogardes\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand les Balayeurs aérogardes arrivent en jeu, vous pouvez renvoyer jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées dans la main de leurs propriétaires.", \'type\': \'Créature : drone\', \'flavor\': "Ils n\'apparaissent qu\'en cas d\'urgence, et celles-ci ne durent jamais longtemps.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80789&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afd3edc3-5b93-4505-87d5-95e3add9a3b4\', \'multiverseId\': 80789}, \'multiverseid\': 80789}, {\'name\': \'Spazzatori Aerocustodi\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando gli Spazzatori Aerocustodi entrano in gioco, puoi far riprendere in mano ai proprietari fino a due creature bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drone\', \'flavor\': \'Appaiono solo in casi di emergenza e le emergenze non durano mai a lungo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94fc2e7b-b181-456e-a1ac-f27d8f5a0388\', \'multiverseId\': 81284}, \'multiverseid\': 81284}, {\'name\': \'空護りの掃討者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n空護りの掃討者が場に出たとき、クリーチャーを最大２体まで対象とする。あなたはそれらをオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'彼らは緊急のときのみ現れるが、その緊急事態も長くは続かない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72ffffcb-f922-41da-850e-fd42f85c0e02\', \'multiverseId\': 80624}, \'multiverseid\': 80624}, {\'name\': \'Guardas-de-Ronda Varredores\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Guardas-de-Ronda Varredores entra em jogo, você pode devolver até duas criaturas alvo para as mãos de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zangão\', \'flavor\': \'Eles só aparecem em emergências, e as emergências costumam não se prolongar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a8e20ee-ae6b-4557-b34f-42ebeee3f8ea\', \'multiverseId\': 81449}, \'multiverseid\': 81449}, {\'name\': \'空卫扫荡队\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当空卫扫荡队进场时，你可以将至多两个目标生物移回其拥有者的手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'他们只在紧急状况现身，而紧急状况从不会持续太久。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b02e5568-361b-40df-9dfb-8007972c67ec\', \'multiverseId\': 81614}, \'multiverseid\': 81614}]', '[{\'name\': \'Augen des Beobachters\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei spielst, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erhältst du Hellsicht 2. (Betrachte die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek und lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek und den Rest oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80933&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bb81467-ae26-4c19-925a-02ff6514ba33\', \'multiverseId\': 80933}, \'multiverseid\': 80933}, {\'name\': \'Ojos del observador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que juegues un hechizo instantáneo o conjuro, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, adivina 2. (Mira las dos primeras cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier número de ellas en la parte inferior de tu biblioteca y el resto, en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c1cf3cc-9fc2-421a-91d0-129c266c86c3\', \'multiverseId\': 81098}, \'multiverseid\': 81098}, {\'name\': \'Les yeux du gardien\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous jouez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, regard 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste, au-dessus, dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80768&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75ca1b68-2b50-438c-98d9-1b168655f6e5\', \'multiverseId\': 80768}, \'multiverseid\': 80768}, {\'name\': "Occhi dell\'Osservatore", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta giochi una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, puoi spendere {1}. Se lo fai, profetizzare 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi metti un qualsiasi numero di esse in fondo al tuo grimorio e le rimanenti in cima a esso nell\'ordine che preferisci.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0cba801-2368-4393-87fc-d7203738a28f\', \'multiverseId\': 81263}, \'multiverseid\': 81263}, {\'name\': \'見張る者の目\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタント呪文かソーサリー呪文をプレイするたび、あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。そうした場合、「占術 ２」を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを見て、その後、そのうち望む枚数をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを一番上に、望む順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント（場）\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2981afb6-b602-4278-9ade-95df4690cbec\', \'multiverseId\': 80603}, \'multiverseid\': 80603}, {\'name\': \'Olhos do Observador\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você jogar uma mágica instantânea ou de feitiço, você pode pagar {1}. Se o fizer, vidência 2. (Olhe os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque qualquer número deles no fundo de seu grimório e o restante no topo em qualquer ordem.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc602c90-e6da-4867-916d-7ab306f8eaeb\', \'multiverseId\': 81428}, \'multiverseid\': 81428}, {\'name\': \'看守者之眼\', \'text\': \'每当你使用瞬间或法术咒语时，你可以支付{1}。若你如此作，则占卜2。（检视你牌库顶的两张牌。将其中任意数量的牌置于你牌库底，其余则置于你牌库顶；你决定牌的顺序。）\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'877762f8-0526-4d57-9986-868728306b37\', \'multiverseId\': 81593}, \'multiverseid\': 81593}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auriok-Champion\', \'text\': \'Schutz vor Schwarz und vor Rot\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kannst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazuerhalten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihr Wille wird die Schatten bannen. Ihre Macht wird die Gesetzlosen bestrafen. Ihre Schönheit wird das Licht wiederbringen." — Ushanti, Leoniden-Seher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80886&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d024528e-e13d-4b05-914a-61d5c17cd3c9\', \'multiverseId\': 80886}, \'multiverseid\': 80886}, {\'name\': \'Campeona áuriok\', \'text\': \'Protección contra negro y contra rojo.\\nSiempre que otra criatura entre en juego, puedes ganar 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Su voluntad desterrará las sombras. Su poder castigará a los revoltosos. Su belleza restaurará la luz." —Ushanti, vidente leonina\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79e2b04a-08e5-408a-8d8c-cf0419040be0\', \'multiverseId\': 81051}, \'multiverseid\': 81051}, {\'name\': \'Championne aurioke\', \'text\': "Protection contre le noir et contre le rouge\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive en jeu, vous pouvez gagner 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Sa volonté repoussera les ombres. Sa puissance punira les infidèles. Et sa beauté ramènera la lumière. » —Ushanti, voyant léonin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80721&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02966fb1-a42a-4916-86df-0c7220a51cd5\', \'multiverseId\': 80721}, \'multiverseid\': 80721}, {\'name\': \'Campionessa Auriok\', \'text\': "Protezione dal nero e dal rosso\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura entra in gioco, puoi guadagnare un punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La sua volontà caccerà le tenebre. Il suo potere punirà i senza legge. La sua bellezza riporterà la luce." —Ushanti, veggente leonid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da123696-a5d9-466d-af1c-9380d313906f\', \'multiverseId\': 81216}, \'multiverseid\': 81216}, {\'name\': \'オーリオックのチャンピオン\', \'text\': \'プロテクション（黒）、プロテクション（赤）\\n他のクリーチャーが場に出るたび、あなたは１点のライフを得てもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'彼女の意思は闇を追いやるじゃろう。彼女の力は無法に罰を与えるじゃろう。彼女の美は光を取り戻すじゃろう。 ―― レオニンの予見者ウシャンティ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58ff49b4-1cb0-46b2-a2cd-921901900ef3\', \'multiverseId\': 80556}, \'multiverseid\': 80556}, {\'name\': \'Campeã dos Aurioques\', \'text\': \'Proteção contra o preto e contra o vermelho\\nToda vez que outra criatura entrar em jogo, você pode ganhar 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sua vontade banirá as sombras. Sua força punirá os sem-lei. Sua beleza restaurará a luz." —Ushanti, vidente leonina\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2a02cd1-8a65-47b6-90dc-e46c1746750f\', \'multiverseId\': 81381}, \'multiverseid\': 81381}, {\'name\': \'欧瑞克斗士\', \'text\': \'反黑保护，反红保护\\n每当另一个生物进场时，你可以获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「志能辟邪，力足伏恶，德堪正道。」 ～狮族先知乌珊提\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06161b98-98e6-4da3-b5ee-afcf0d5aec36\', \'multiverseId\': 81546}, \'multiverseid\': 81546}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auriok-Wiederverwerter\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 1 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Memnarch und die Vedalken verwerten die meisten Teile der großen Maschinen und lassen uns nur den Schrott. Aber der Schrott reicht uns."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80887&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20d7eec7-666b-4f83-91e6-8407118eed2d\', \'multiverseId\': 80887}, \'multiverseid\': 80887}, {\'name\': \'Desarmadores áuriok\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 1 o menos de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Memnarch o los vedalken desarman la mayoría de las máquinas grandes, dejándonos sólo despojos. Los despojos serán suficiente."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29d1f3c4-7fc4-4adf-99e9-8c670a89e71f\', \'multiverseId\': 81052}, \'multiverseid\': 81052}, {\'name\': \'Récupérateurs aurioks\', \'text\': "{1}{W} : Renvoyez la carte d\'artefact avec un coût converti de mana de 1 ou moins ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Memnarch et les vedalkens récupèrent toutes les grandes machines. Il ne nous reste que de la ferraille, mais cela nous suffit. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80722&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'116bafa3-9758-4f77-8939-a9e2ac22d7ba\', \'multiverseId\': 80722}, \'multiverseid\': 80722}, {\'name\': \'Saccheggiatori Auriok\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Riprendi in mano dal tuo cimitero una carta artefatto bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Memnarch o i vedalken saccheggiano la maggior parte dei macchinari più grandi, lasciandoci solo gli avanzi. Ma per noi sono abbastanza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'587a5baa-6997-41da-aff8-48eb5b6212ca\', \'multiverseId\': 81217}, \'multiverseid\': 81217}, {\'name\': \'オーリオックの廃品回収者\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}：あなたの墓地にある、点数で見たマナ・コストが１以下のアーティファクト･カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'メムナークやヴィダルケンが大型の機械をほとんど引き上げちまったから、残りは屑鉄ばかりだよ。屑鉄でも十分だけどな。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e938e7c8-815c-430b-b2f0-973154e5a657\', \'multiverseId\': 80557}, \'multiverseid\': 80557}, {\'name\': \'Salvádegos dos Aurioques\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Devolve o card alvo de artefato com custo de mana convertido menor ou igual a 1 de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"O Memnarca ou os vedalkeanos recolhem a maioria das máquinas grandes, deixando-nos somente a sucata. A sucata é suficiente."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dc89e17-2246-4ab4-b6bf-6ca4ded52c98\', \'multiverseId\': 81382}, \'multiverseid\': 81382}, {\'name\': \'欧瑞克修护士\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}：将目标总法术力费用等于或小于1的神器牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「大型机械几乎都被蒙纳珂或是维多肯族回收利用，我们只有废铁可捡。但废铁便已堪用了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6699e0c-928b-461c-a161-7f99f89a6cca\', \'multiverseId\': 81547}, \'multiverseid\': 81547}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auriok-Windwanderer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{T}: Lege eine Ausrüstung deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, an.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'In jeder Generation wird einer Handvoll junger Frauen der Auriok erlaubt, in die Höhle des Lichts zu ziehen. Bei ihrer Rückkehr reiten sie auf dem Wind und schwingen Stahl.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80888&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50181e60-b660-4da7-baf3-e7864295f6ab\', \'multiverseId\': 80888}, \'multiverseid\': 80888}, {\'name\': \'Cabalgavientos áuriok\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{T}: Anexa el equipo objetivo que controles a la criatura objetivo que controles.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'En cada generación, unas pocas niñas áuriok pueden visitar la Cueva de la luz. Regresan cabalgando en el viento y con acero en sus manos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5280a14-4dd9-41b9-93b6-fc3a8742ea69\', \'multiverseId\': 81053}, \'multiverseid\': 81053}, {\'name\': \'Marchevent aurioke\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{T} : Attachez l\'équipement ciblé que vous contrôlez à la créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "À chaque génération, une poignée de filles auriokes sont autorisées à visiter la Caverne de lumière. Toutes reviennent, chevauchant le vent et brandissant l\'acier.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80723&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5427f0f9-5a8b-44fa-87ab-33af26a2430e\', \'multiverseId\': 80723}, \'multiverseid\': 80723}, {\'name\': \'Calcavento Auriok\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{T}: Assegna un Equipaggiamento bersaglio che controlli a una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'A ogni generazione, alcune ragazze Auriok ricevono il permesso di visitare la Caverna della Luce. Tornano cavalcando il vento e brandendo il metallo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a753316-d6a4-415e-a63e-e4df70c867f4\', \'multiverseId\': 81218}, \'multiverseid\': 81218}, {\'name\': \'オーリオックの風歩き\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{T}：あなたがコントロールしている装備品１つと、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、その装備品をそのクリーチャーにつける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'世代ごとに幾人かのオーリオックの娘が光の洞穴に入ることを許される。そして彼女たちは、風に乗り鋼を振りかざして戻ってくるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eef04272-4236-426c-8de5-d37d15f18739\', \'multiverseId\': 80558}, \'multiverseid\': 80558}, {\'name\': \'Aurioque Caminhante do Vento\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{T}: Anexe o Equipamento alvo que você controla à criatura alvo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago Humano\', \'flavor\': \'A cada geração, permite-se que algumas garotas Aurioques visitem a Caverna da Luz. Elas voltam cavalgando o vento e brandindo aço.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aeac04b-a245-45ec-ac51-a092e938ea50\', \'multiverseId\': 81383}, \'multiverseid\': 81383}, {\'name\': \'欧瑞克风渡师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{T}：将目标由你操控的武具装备在目标由你操控的生物上。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'每代都有群欧瑞克女孩获准至明光洞窟见习；尔后她们将御风舞剑而归。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf001dd0-ab2c-4b58-853d-607bdf53d182\', \'multiverseId\': 81548}, \'multiverseid\': 81548}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bergungsstation\', \'text\': \'{T}: Bringe eine Nichtkreaturartefaktkarte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 1 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du die Bergungsstation enttappen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81000&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a348746-3a7e-4f4d-948b-10b37af67b2e\', \'multiverseId\': 81000}, \'multiverseid\': 81000}, {\'name\': \'Puesto de desarme\', \'text\': \'{T}: Regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo que no sea criatura con coste de maná convertido de 1 o menos de tu cementerio al juego.\\nSiempre que una criatura vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, puedes enderezar el Puesto de desarme.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87930dba-a544-41f6-b173-61fbc46eda09\', \'multiverseId\': 81165}, \'multiverseid\': 81165}, {\'name\': \'Poste de récupération\', \'text\': "{T} : Renvoyez la carte d\'artefact non-créature avec un coût converti de mana de 1 ou moins ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature est mise dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, vous pouvez dégager le Poste de récupération.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80835&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecf56927-fb1e-4d1d-bc96-e2487179f1b2\', \'multiverseId\': 80835}, \'multiverseid\': 80835}, {\'name\': \'Postazione di Recupero\', \'text\': \'{T}: Rimetti in gioco dal tuo cimitero una carta artefatto non creatura bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 1.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, puoi STAPpare la Postazione di Recupero.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6de791f-4eb2-4b21-8905-d4479d41fc9b\', \'multiverseId\': 81330}, \'multiverseid\': 81330}, {\'name\': \'救助基地\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの墓地にある、点数で見たマナ・コストが１以下のクリーチャーでないアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とし、それを場に戻す。\\nいずれかのクリーチャーが場から墓地に置かれるたび、救助基地をアンタップしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3690a5d-d8f4-4af6-8f7a-e2c2e1723d57\', \'multiverseId\': 80670}, \'multiverseid\': 80670}, {\'name\': \'Estação de Salvados\', \'text\': \'{T}: Devolve o card alvo de artefato que não seja uma criatura com custo de mana convertido menor ou igual a 1 de seu cemitério para o jogo.\\nToda vez que uma criatura for colocada num cemitério vinda de jogo, você pode desvirar Estação de Salvados.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b9e910b-14d2-40fb-9cd7-e73f007b709c\', \'multiverseId\': 81495}, \'multiverseid\': 81495}, {\'name\': \'回收工段\', \'text\': \'{T}：将目标非生物，且总法术力费用等于或小于1的神器牌从你的坟墓场移回场上。\\n每当一个生物从场上进入坟墓场时，你可以重置回收工段。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18023022-e351-4e98-8548-7ecf9dbf20a0\', \'multiverseId\': 81660}, \'multiverseid\': 81660}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beschwörungsstation\', \'text\': \'{T}: Bringe einen 2/2 farblosen Kneiferkreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\\nImmer wenn ein Artefakt aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du die Beschwörungsstation enttappen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81020&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b32706e-1125-4c3c-b587-365945b65dbb\', \'multiverseId\': 81020}, \'multiverseid\': 81020}, {\'name\': \'Puesto de invocación\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pon en juego una ficha de criatura Tenaza incolora 2/2.\\nSiempre que un artefacto vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, puedes enderezar el Puesto de invocación.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96dcf121-3ada-471c-b2b4-719882dc4257\', \'multiverseId\': 81185}, \'multiverseid\': 81185}, {\'name\': "Poste d\'invocation", \'text\': "{T} : Mettez en jeu un jeton de créature 2/2 incolore Pinceur.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un artefact est mis dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, vous pouvez dégager le Poste d\'invocation.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d68a0c0e-9c84-4982-a131-6fdc859b76d5\', \'multiverseId\': 80855}, \'multiverseid\': 80855}, {\'name\': \'Postazione di Evocazione\', \'text\': \'{T}: Metti in gioco una pedina creatura Pungitore 2/2 incolore.\\nOgniqualvolta un artefatto viene messo in un cimitero dal gioco, puoi STAPpare la Postazione di Evocazione.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6201e7e-1b82-4baf-ad63-b4d35ff18784\', \'multiverseId\': 81350}, \'multiverseid\': 81350}, {\'name\': \'召喚基地\', \'text\': \'{T}：無色の2/2のピンチャー・クリーチャー・トークンを１個場に出す。\\nいずれかのアーティファクトが場から墓地に置かれるたび、あなたは召喚基地をアンタップしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0798c32d-386d-4b42-8738-18054b2f32a9\', \'multiverseId\': 80690}, \'multiverseid\': 80690}, {\'name\': \'Estação de Invocação\', \'text\': \'{T}: Coloque em jogo uma ficha de criatura incolor 2/2 do tipo Beliscador.\\nToda vez que um artefato for colocado num cemitério vindo de jogo, você pode desvirar Estação de Invocação.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2e085bc-f0bc-4879-836f-c8159b6e98d3\', \'multiverseId\': 81515}, \'multiverseid\': 81515}, {\'name\': \'召唤工段\', \'text\': \'{T}：将一个2/2无色钳手衍生物放置进场。\\n每当一个神器从场上进入坟墓场时，你可以重置召唤工段。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c1f8b61-2978-4cc2-9d11-8bb87e429bce\', \'multiverseId\': 81680}, \'multiverseid\': 81680}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beseelter Krummsäbel\', \'text\': \'{3}: Der Beseelte Krummsäbel wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 1/5 Artefaktkreatur mit Flugfähigkeit. (Ausrüstung, die gleichzeitig eine Kreatur ist, kann keine Kreatur ausrüsten.)\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+5.\\nAusrüsten {2}({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, an. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80929&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83b15ead-0f46-4322-bf8b-501eaa66e4d6\', \'multiverseId\': 80929}, \'multiverseid\': 80929}, {\'name\': \'Cimitarra animada\', \'text\': \'{3}: La Cimitarra animada se convierte en una criatura artefacto 1/5 con la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno. (El equipo que sea una criatura no puede equipar a otras criaturas.)\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +1/+5.\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexa este equipo a la criatura objetivo que controles. Juega la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9dfbb34-1813-4b9f-b11c-76c5f53c228f\', \'multiverseId\': 81094}, \'multiverseid\': 81094}, {\'name\': \'Cimeterre animé\', \'text\': "{3} : Le Cimeterre animé devient une créature-artefact 1/5 avec le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (L\'équipement qui est aussi une créature ne peut pas équiper une créature.)\\nLa créature équipée gagne +1/+5.\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à la créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez jouer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80764&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c11676f-051e-4703-8e45-8413e2270ef5\', \'multiverseId\': 80764}, \'multiverseid\': 80764}, {\'name\': \'Scimitarra Animata\', \'text\': \'{3}: La Scimitarra Animata diventa una creatura artefatto 1/5 con volare fino alla fine del turno. (Un Equipaggiamento che è anche una creatura non può Equipaggiare una creatura.)\\nLa creatura Equipaggiata prende +1/+5.\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegnala a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggiala solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50f2c6d0-1eec-4935-8c43-f4f994462d38\', \'multiverseId\': 81259}, \'multiverseid\': 81259}, {\'name\': \'魂込めの円月刀\', \'text\': \'{3}：魂込めの円月刀はターン終了時まで、飛行を持つ１/5のアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。（クリーチャーでない装備品はクリーチャーに装備されない。）\\n装備されているクリーチャーは+1/+5の修整を受ける。\\n装備 {2} （{2}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92c34552-1d9d-41d1-9659-7558199929e8\', \'multiverseId\': 80599}, \'multiverseid\': 80599}, {\'name\': \'Cimitarra Dotada de Alma\', \'text\': \'{3}: Cimitarra Dotada de Alma torna-se uma criatura artefato 1/5, com a habilidade de voar, até o final do turno. (Equipamentos que forem criaturas não podem equipar uma criatura.)\\nA criatura equipada recebe +1/+5.\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexe a uma criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente quando pudesse jogar um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dc857b3-0265-4ab2-a601-4c119d94fb31\', \'multiverseId\': 81424}, \'multiverseid\': 81424}, {\'name\': \'缄灵弯刀\', \'text\': \'{3}：直到回合结束，缄灵弯刀成为1/5，具飞行异能的神器生物。（若武具是生物，便无法由生物佩带。）\\n佩带此武具的生物得+1/+5。\\n佩带{2}（{2}：装备在目标由你操控的生物上；佩带的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78de1a3c-0df6-4825-abf0-79136bf0817b\', \'multiverseId\': 81589}, \'multiverseid\': 81589}]', '[{\'name\': \'Besessenes Portal\', \'text\': \'Falls ein Spieler eine Karte ziehen würde, übergeht dieser Spieler das Ziehen stattdessen.\\nAm Ende jedes Zuges opfert jeder Spieler eine bleibende Karte, falls er nicht eine Karte aus seiner Hand abwirft.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80987&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cd4d40f-f979-4ae0-9e37-27e1f0e90ee6\', \'multiverseId\': 80987}, \'multiverseid\': 80987}, {\'name\': \'Portal poseído\', \'text\': \'Si un jugador fuera a robar una carta, en vez de eso, ese jugador salta ese robo.\\nAl final de cada turno, cada jugador sacrifica un permanente a menos que descarte una carta de su mano.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2475cec-1d91-405e-83d7-25121965140d\', \'multiverseId\': 81152}, \'multiverseid\': 81152}, {\'name\': \'Portail possédé\', \'text\': "Si un joueur devait piocher une carte, ce joueur passe cette pioche à la place.\\nÀ la fin de chaque tour, chaque joueur sacrifie un permanent à moins qu\'il ne se défausse d\'une carte de sa main.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80822&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'754a6bef-919d-416e-afb4-ea50cf2946ab\', \'multiverseId\': 80822}, \'multiverseid\': 80822}, {\'name\': \'Portale Posseduto\', \'text\': \'Se un giocatore pesca una carta, invece quel giocatore non pesca quella carta.\\nAlla fine di ogni turno, ciascun giocatore sacrifica un permanente a meno che scarti una carta dalla propria mano.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85d25f60-95bf-4a24-ba27-56c68f7211b1\', \'multiverseId\': 81317}, \'multiverseid\': 81317}, {\'name\': \'取り憑かれた扉\', \'text\': \'いずれかのプレイヤーがカードを引く場合、代わりにそのプレイヤーはそのカードを引くことをとばす。\\n各ターンの終了時に、各プレイヤーは自分の手札からカードを１枚捨てないかぎり、パーマネントを１つ生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f22e013e-6c00-45c5-bceb-a161ba93178a\', \'multiverseId\': 80657}, \'multiverseid\': 80657}, {\'name\': \'Portal Possuído\', \'text\': \'Se um jogador fosse comprar um card, em vez disso o jogador pula aquela compra.\\nNo final de cada turno, cada jogador sacrifica uma permanente a menos que descarte um card da própria mão.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f87fe2c-a14d-4558-a372-18369cb07678\', \'multiverseId\': 81482}, \'multiverseid\': 81482}, {\'name\': \'着魔时空通道\', \'text\': \'若任何牌手将抓一张牌，改为该牌手略过该次抓牌。\\n在每个回合结束时，每位牌手除非从其手上弃掉一张牌，否则该牌手牺牲一个永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44140da7-356b-4f70-a91a-b14179bb1efd\', \'multiverseId\': 81647}, \'multiverseid\': 81647}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bewaffnete Antwort\', \'text\': \'Bewaffnete Antwort fügt einer angreifenden Kreatur deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Anzahl der Ausrüstungen, die du kontrollierst, zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Raksha beobachtete die Goblins, die weiterhin auf die Rasierklingenfelder strömten. „Sie wissen einfach nicht, wann man aufhören muss, nicht wahr?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80884&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a83cf9ea-986e-4bba-ac35-a0f6c881b058\', \'multiverseId\': 80884}, \'multiverseid\': 80884}, {\'name\': \'Respuesta armada\', \'text\': \'La Respuesta armada hace daño a la criatura atacante objetivo igual a la cantidad de equipos que controles.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Raksha observó cómo los trasgos continuaban su avance sobre los Campos navaja. "¿Es que acaso no saben dónde detenerse?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ad6926b-0942-46b7-9236-bb86e27c0da6\', \'multiverseId\': 81049}, \'multiverseid\': 81049}, {\'name\': \'Réponse armée\', \'text\': "La Réponse armée inflige à la créature attaquante ciblée un nombre de blessures égal au nombre d\'équipements que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Raksha observait les gobelins qui se déversaient sur les Champs de rasoirs. « Ils ne savent vraiment pas s\'arrêter. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80719&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b1189e2-fdc6-4868-a862-e17d708ee985\', \'multiverseId\': 80719}, \'multiverseid\': 80719}, {\'name\': \'Reazione Armata\', \'text\': \'La Reazione Armata infligge a una creatura attaccante bersaglio un ammontare di danni pari al numero di Equipaggiamenti che tu controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Raksha guardava i goblin che si riversavano senza sosta sui Campi Taglienti. "Non sanno proprio quando fermarsi, vero?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'745ae202-0a2a-4393-9173-0ed76c5d29de\', \'multiverseId\': 81214}, \'multiverseid\': 81214}, {\'name\': \'武力対応\', \'text\': \'攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。武力対応はそれに、あなたがコントロールする装備品の総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ラクシャはゴブリンが剃刀ヶ原になだれ込むのを見て思った。彼らは止まるタイミングを知らないんじゃないだろうかと。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec0058fa-99c5-4aae-85fa-3220cb61268c\', \'multiverseId\': 80554}, \'multiverseid\': 80554}, {\'name\': \'Resposta Armada\', \'text\': \'Resposta Armada causa à criatura alvo atacante uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de Equipamentos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Raksha observava os goblins, que continuavam a inundar os Campos Cortantes. "Eles simplesmente não sabem quando parar, não é?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72fe9506-9124-4563-b33d-0107bb66fa1b\', \'multiverseId\': 81379}, \'multiverseid\': 81379}, {\'name\': \'武装回应\', \'text\': \'武装回应对目标进行攻击的生物造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控的武具数量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'望着精灵前仆后继涌入锐草原野，拉夏道：「他们就是不懂何时该收手，对不对？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88aaa2e8-fbf7-4d9f-b2db-ecff224b16bd\', \'multiverseId\': 81544}, \'multiverseid\': 81544}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blinder Kriecher\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen Zauberspruch spielt, erhält der Blinde Kriecher -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Er weicht allem aus außer seiner nächsten Mahlzeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80898&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'068b4655-9552-4859-9eeb-c5f8657b2979\', \'multiverseId\': 80898}, \'multiverseid\': 80898}, {\'name\': \'Trepador ciego\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador juegue un hechizo, el Trepador ciego obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Evita todo excepto su próxima comida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc88ea76-4dbe-4617-a2ad-6868c8d96147\', \'multiverseId\': 81063}, \'multiverseid\': 81063}, {\'name\': \'Fureteur aveugle\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur joue un sort, le Fureteur aveugle gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et bête\', \'flavor\': "Son prochain repas est la seule chose qu\'il n\'esquive pas.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80733&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bce209c-86dd-4c91-9fe6-0ed42005452e\', \'multiverseId\': 80733}, \'multiverseid\': 80733}, {\'name\': \'Strisciante Cieco\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore gioca una magia, lo Strisciante Cieco prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Evita qualsiasi cosa, tranne il suo prossimo pranzo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15d203ed-d39c-42d3-9117-9c3a6d8bd857\', \'multiverseId\': 81228}, \'multiverseid\': 81228}, {\'name\': \'盲目の忍び寄るもの\', \'text\': \'いずれかのプレイヤーが呪文をプレイするたび、盲目の忍び寄るものはターン終了時まで-1/-1の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'そいつは次の餌以外からは身を潜める。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62b6aca6-9453-46a8-b5a2-8e3f3d2f7761\', \'multiverseId\': 80568}, \'multiverseid\': 80568}, {\'name\': \'Rastejador Cego\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador jogar uma mágica, Rastejador Cego recebe -1/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Ele foge de tudo menos de sua próxima refeição.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4743be60-182e-4569-a724-3a2da3ac405f\', \'multiverseId\': 81393}, \'multiverseid\': 81393}, {\'name\': \'盲目匍行兽\', \'text\': \'每当牌手使用咒语时，盲目匍行兽得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／野兽\', \'flavor\': \'除了餐点之外，它什么都不想招惹。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21feac3f-7158-429b-a970-597af3b0bf93\', \'multiverseId\': 81558}, \'multiverseid\': 81558}]', "[{'name': 'Blinkmotten-Infusion', 'text': 'Affinität zu Artefakten (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Ausspielen für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.)\\nEnttappe alle Artefakte.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Macht erzeugt Macht.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80899&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f66c90c-1408-4dbd-af08-2f4402d86bef', 'multiverseId': 80899}, 'multiverseid': 80899}, {'name': 'Infusión de polillas titilantes', 'text': 'Afinidad por artefactos. (Este hechizo te cuesta {1} menos para jugarlo por cada artefacto que controles.)\\nEndereza todos los artefactos.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'El poder engendra poder.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81064&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a286169-69ac-49ec-bb76-e42b51206c09', 'multiverseId': 81064}, 'multiverseid': 81064}, {'name': 'Décoction de scintimite', 'text': 'Affinité pour les artefacts (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à jouer pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez.)\\nDégagez tous les artefacts.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'La puissance engendre la puissance.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80734&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b53455e-53ff-4c9e-a5cf-19d75cfe2861', 'multiverseId': 80734}, 'multiverseid': 80734}, {'name': 'Infusione di Lampidotteri', 'text': 'Affinità con gli artefatti (Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere giocata per ogni artefatto che controlli.)\\nSTAPpa tutti gli artefatti.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Il potere genera potere.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81229&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e39fb02e-5e0f-4bf5-a72b-60960241cc59', 'multiverseId': 81229}, 'multiverseid': 81229}, {'name': 'ちらつき蛾の注入', 'text': '親和（アーティファクト） （この呪文をプレイするためのコストは、あなたがコントロールするアーティファクト１つにつき{1}少なくなる。）\\nすべてのアーティファクトをアンタップする。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '力は力を生む。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80569&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cfccd35-b154-4621-9540-1f99a328e958', 'multiverseId': 80569}, 'multiverseid': 80569}, {'name': 'Infusão de Moscolumes', 'text': 'Afinidade por artefatos (Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para jogar para cada artefato que você controla.)\\nDesvira todos os artefatos.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Poder gera poder.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81394&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4f05c8f-409a-40b8-a80a-66a854e84fb2', 'multiverseId': 81394}, 'multiverseid': 81394}, {'name': '光蛾灌输', 'text': '神器共鸣（你每操控一个神器，使用此咒语的费用便减少{1}来使用）\\n重置所有神器。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '力量产生更多力量。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81559&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e8864c9-6a21-45d9-8011-83433a2a41bd', 'multiverseId': 81559}, 'multiverseid': 81559}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bringer des Blauen Morgens\', \'text\': \'Du kannst {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} bezahlen, anstatt die Manakosten des Bringers des Blauen Morgens zu bezahlen.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du 2 Karten ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bringer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80901&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d38d3ff3-3e32-4218-80bd-1477a4f41935\', \'multiverseId\': 80901}, \'multiverseid\': 80901}, {\'name\': \'Adalid del amanecer azul\', \'text\': \'Puedes pagar {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} en lugar de pagar el coste de maná del Adalid del amanecer azul.\\nArrolla.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes robar dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Adalid\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e61000c5-39eb-4cf0-b805-670e9bd917fb\', \'multiverseId\': 81066}, \'multiverseid\': 81066}, {\'name\': "Annonciateur de l\'Aube bleue", \'text\': "Vous pouvez payer {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} à la place du coût de mana de l\'Annonciateur de l\'Aube bleue.\\nPiétinement\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez piocher deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature : annonciateur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80736&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a0622b-bb55-4960-bd96-223ca4dfb81e\', \'multiverseId\': 80736}, \'multiverseid\': 80736}, {\'name\': "Portatore dell\'Alba Blu", \'text\': "Puoi spendere {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} invece di pagare il costo di mana del Portatore dell\'Alba Blu.\\nTravolgere\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi pescare due carte.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Portatore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e7d0a87-1124-4b08-b93c-fe06d912feda\', \'multiverseId\': 81231}, \'multiverseid\': 81231}, {\'name\': \'青の夜明けの運び手\', \'text\': \'あなたは青の夜明けの運び手のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}を支払ってもよい。\\nトランプル\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはカードを２枚引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 運び手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a9f4f73-11a8-4ce3-8a2c-7b6b36d4f8c0\', \'multiverseId\': 80571}, \'multiverseid\': 80571}, {\'name\': \'Portador da Aurora Azul\', \'text\': \'Você pode pagar {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} em vez de pagar o custo de mana do Portador da Aurora Azul.\\nAtropelar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, você pode comprar dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Portador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f693a10e-0d6c-44c1-bef2-7e16d8d26121\', \'multiverseId\': 81396}, \'multiverseid\': 81396}, {\'name\': \'蓝曙光信使\', \'text\': \'你可支付{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}，而不支付蓝曙光信使的法术力费用。\\n践踏\\n在你的维持开始时，你可以抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～信使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5812b990-10ed-487f-ae36-8e8d6912e2d5\', \'multiverseId\': 81561}, \'multiverseid\': 81561}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bringer des Grünen Morgens\', \'text\': \'Du kannst {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} bezahlen, anstatt die Manakosten des Bringers des Grünen Morgens zu bezahlen.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden.\\nDu kannst zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments einen 3/3 grünen Bestienspielstein ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bringer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80902&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d9e2c4-9d0c-4362-95ed-70d1b8785932\', \'multiverseId\': 80902}, \'multiverseid\': 80902}, {\'name\': \'Adalid del amanecer verde\', \'text\': \'Puedes pagar {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} en lugar de pagar el coste de maná del Adalid del amanecer verde.\\nArrolla.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes poner en juego una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Adalid\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6e0de9b-d033-44df-a558-e69bc733d7b5\', \'multiverseId\': 81067}, \'multiverseid\': 81067}, {\'name\': "Annonciateur de l\'Aube verte", \'text\': "Vous pouvez payer {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} à la place du coût de mana de l\'Annonciateur de l\'Aube verte.\\nPiétinement\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez mettre en jeu un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Bête.", \'type\': \'Créature : annonciateur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80737&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95a2faeb-080a-4a65-b2f6-47592e93485b\', \'multiverseId\': 80737}, \'multiverseid\': 80737}, {\'name\': "Portatore dell\'Alba Verde", \'text\': "Puoi spendere {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} invece di pagare il costo di mana del Portatore dell\'Alba Verde.\\nTravolgere\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi mettere in gioco una pedina creatura Bestia 3/3 verde.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Portatore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e33c1450-eb9a-40c9-896f-b186f2e8522f\', \'multiverseId\': 81232}, \'multiverseid\': 81232}, {\'name\': \'緑の夜明けの運び手\', \'text\': \'あなたは緑の夜明けの運び手のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}を支払ってもよい。\\nトランプル\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは緑の3/3のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１個場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 運び手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7556a84-d120-4553-8d57-32dd9a692519\', \'multiverseId\': 80572}, \'multiverseid\': 80572}, {\'name\': \'Portador da Aurora Verde\', \'text\': \'Você pode pagar {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} em vez de pagar o custo de mana do Portador da Aurora Verde.\\nAtropelar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, você pode colocar em jogo uma ficha de criatura verde 3/3 do tipo Besta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Portador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff05171c-beae-4146-8532-42018b22dda8\', \'multiverseId\': 81397}, \'multiverseid\': 81397}, {\'name\': \'绿曙光信使\', \'text\': \'你可支付{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}，而不支付绿曙光信使的法术力费用。\\n践踏\\n在你的维持开始时，你可以将一个3/3绿色野兽衍生物放置进场。\', \'type\': \'生物～信使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f4ae254-d48b-4eb9-af09-daf13cd5738d\', \'multiverseId\': 81562}, \'multiverseid\': 81562}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bringer des Roten Morgens\', \'text\': \'Du kannst {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} bezahlen, anstatt die Manakosten des Bringers des Roten Morgens zu bezahlen.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl enttappen und bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über sie übernehmen. Diese Kreatur erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bringer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80903&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26a901ff-0fd9-4dd1-acf7-b831aca8dad7\', \'multiverseId\': 80903}, \'multiverseid\': 80903}, {\'name\': \'Adalid del amanecer rojo\', \'text\': \'Puedes pagar {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} en lugar de pagar el coste de maná del Adalid del amanecer rojo.\\nArrolla.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes enderezar la criatura objetivo y ganar el control de ella hasta el final del turno. Esa criatura gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Adalid\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f354e3d0-1443-4448-a838-c9330c69c6e5\', \'multiverseId\': 81068}, \'multiverseid\': 81068}, {\'name\': "Annonciateur de l\'Aube rouge", \'text\': "Vous pouvez payer {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} à la place du coût de mana de l\'Annonciateur de l\'Aube rouge.\\nPiétinement\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez dégager la créature ciblée et en acquérir le contrôle jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Cette créature acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : annonciateur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80738&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91f169db-1ff7-4b74-8774-b08e05c15edb\', \'multiverseId\': 80738}, \'multiverseid\': 80738}, {\'name\': "Portatore dell\'Alba Rossa", \'text\': "Puoi spendere {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} invece di pagare il costo di mana del Portatore dell\'Alba Rossa.\\nTravolgere\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi STAPpare una creatura bersaglio e prenderne il controllo fino alla fine del turno. Quella creatura guadagna rapidità fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Portatore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63260543-0837-4e2e-a853-65f9610fe352\', \'multiverseId\': 81233}, \'multiverseid\': 81233}, {\'name\': \'赤の夜明けの運び手\', \'text\': \'あなたは赤の夜明けの運び手のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}を支払ってもよい。\\nトランプル\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれをアンタップし、ターン終了時までそれのコントロールを得てもよい。それはターン終了時まで速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 運び手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5d91c29-6c62-42a4-a571-62ec093553ee\', \'multiverseId\': 80573}, \'multiverseid\': 80573}, {\'name\': \'Portador da Aurora Vermelha\', \'text\': \'Você pode pagar {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} em vez de pagar o custo de mana do Portador da Aurora Vermelha.\\nAtropelar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, você pode desvirar a criatura alvo e ganhar o controle dela até o final do turno. A criatura ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Portador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0a6ad19-4e65-4e1a-ba7a-4053423edbf9\', \'multiverseId\': 81398}, \'multiverseid\': 81398}, {\'name\': \'红曙光信使\', \'text\': \'你可支付{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}，而不支付红曙光信使的法术力费用。\\n践踏\\n在你的维持开始时，你可以重置目标生物并获得其操控权直到回合结束。该生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～信使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'887657c5-1a92-4439-a247-1001d20c668e\', \'multiverseId\': 81563}, \'multiverseid\': 81563}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bringer des Schwarzen Morgens\', \'text\': \'Du kannst {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} bezahlen, anstatt die Manakosten des Bringers des Schwarzen Morgens zu bezahlen.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte, mische dann deine Bibliothek und lege diese Karte oben auf deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bringer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80900&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15c0a4ba-a829-457b-a001-c0262021a075\', \'multiverseId\': 80900}, \'multiverseid\': 80900}, {\'name\': \'Adalid del amanecer negro\', \'text\': \'Puedes pagar {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} en lugar de pagar el coste de maná del Adalid del amanecer negro.\\nArrolla.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes pagar 2 vidas. Si lo haces, busca una carta en tu biblioteca, luego barájala y pon esa carta en la parte superior de la biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Adalid\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbd9b75c-59bf-4a38-8f07-ab20746fa01e\', \'multiverseId\': 81065}, \'multiverseid\': 81065}, {\'name\': "Annonciateur de l\'Aube noire", \'text\': "Vous pouvez payer {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} à la place du coût de mana de l\'Annonciateur de l\'Aube noire.\\nPiétinement\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous faites ainsi, cherchez une carte dans votre bibliothèque, mélangez votre bibliothèque et mettez ensuite cette carte au-dessus d\'elle.", \'type\': \'Créature : annonciateur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80735&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dfa4767-3718-4651-9a13-9bd01f8e06ac\', \'multiverseId\': 80735}, \'multiverseid\': 80735}, {\'name\': "Portatore dell\'Alba Nera", \'text\': "Puoi spendere {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} invece di pagare il costo di mana del Portatore dell\'Alba Nera.\\nTravolgere\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi pagare 2 punti vita. Se lo fai, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio e metti quella carta in cima a esso.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Portatore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c24d6d0-84ea-4553-b9e5-8505414dc2b5\', \'multiverseId\': 81230}, \'multiverseid\': 81230}, {\'name\': \'黒の夜明けの運び手\', \'text\': \'あなたは黒の夜明けを運び手のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}を支払ってもよい。\\nトランプル\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは２点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうした場合、あなたのライブラリーからカードを１枚探し、その後ライブラリーを切り直してそのカードを一番上に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 運び手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'554a1a2a-5d33-4f89-9b57-9e56c9449a32\', \'multiverseId\': 80570}, \'multiverseid\': 80570}, {\'name\': \'Portador da Aurora Preta\', \'text\': \'Você pode pagar {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} em vez de pagar o custo de mana do Portador da Aurora Preta.\\nAtropelar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, você pode pagar 2 pontos de vida. Se o fizer, procure em seu grimório por um card, embaralhe o seu grimório e depois coloque aquele card no topo dele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Portador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e45c539-e085-48a7-9941-3e808e16854c\', \'multiverseId\': 81395}, \'multiverseid\': 81395}, {\'name\': \'黑曙光信使\', \'text\': \'你可支付{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}，而不支付黑曙光信使的法术力费用。\\n践踏\\n在你的维持开始时，你可以支付2点生命。若你如此作，则从你的牌库中搜寻一张牌，然后将你的牌库洗牌，并将该牌置于其上。\', \'type\': \'生物～信使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f031ca-b512-4f3a-9b78-f4cc3514cf24\', \'multiverseId\': 81560}, \'multiverseid\': 81560}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bringer des Weißen Morgens\', \'text\': \'Du kannst {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} bezahlen, anstatt die Manakosten des Bringers des Weißen Morgens zu bezahlen.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden.\\nDu darfst zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bringer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9752c0c6-4f92-44f1-9994-364ca4317c2b\', \'multiverseId\': 80904}, \'multiverseid\': 80904}, {\'name\': \'Adalid del amanecer blanco\', \'text\': \'Puedes pagar {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} en lugar de pagar el coste de maná del Adalid del amanecer blanco.\\nArrolla.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes regresar la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio al juego.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Adalid\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c998725-afa4-407e-bd0a-67c688de973e\', \'multiverseId\': 81069}, \'multiverseid\': 81069}, {\'name\': "Annonciateur de l\'Aube blanche", \'text\': "Vous pouvez payer {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} à la place du coût de mana de l\'Annonciateur de l\'Aube blanche.\\nPiétinement\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez renvoyer en jeu la carte d\'artefact ciblée de votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : annonciateur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80739&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f57d3a3c-e071-425e-87c8-201912ae3012\', \'multiverseId\': 80739}, \'multiverseid\': 80739}, {\'name\': "Portatore dell\'Alba Bianca", \'text\': "Puoi spendere {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} invece di pagare il costo di mana del Portatore dell\'Alba Bianca.\\nTravolgere\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi rimettere in gioco una carta artefatto bersaglio presente nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Portatore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b2adfd9-6729-49ce-9115-ae5d9c0dc88e\', \'multiverseId\': 81234}, \'multiverseid\': 81234}, {\'name\': \'白の夜明けの運び手\', \'text\': \'あなたは白の夜明けの運び手のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}を支払ってもよい。\\nトランプル\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 運び手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87339846-e2bf-4cae-b357-0a506984800f\', \'multiverseId\': 80574}, \'multiverseid\': 80574}, {\'name\': \'Portador da Aurora Branca\', \'text\': \'Você pode pagar {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} em vez de pagar o custo de mana do Portador da Aurora Branca.\\nAtropelar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, você pode devolver o card alvo de artefato de seu cemitério para o jogo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Portador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29fe1d6b-6d88-4b84-ba39-a92adff49d88\', \'multiverseId\': 81399}, \'multiverseid\': 81399}, {\'name\': \'白曙光信使\', \'text\': \'你可支付{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}，而不支付白曙光信使的法术力费用。\\n践踏\\n在你的维持开始时，你可以将目标神器牌从你的坟墓场移回场上。\', \'type\': \'生物～信使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58438219-6d6d-45aa-97d3-9a3313e01c6b\', \'multiverseId\': 81564}, \'multiverseid\': 81564}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brosche des Geisterrufers\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Brosche des Geisterrufers: Lege bis zu einer Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof unter deine Bibliothek. Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Dies ist der Moment der Entdeckung, der Triumph des Verstands, die Erinnerung an vergangenen Ruhm.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80913&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5232fa5c-927d-4296-927f-b65ce2e22205\', \'multiverseId\': 80913}, \'multiverseid\': 80913}, {\'name\': \'Baratija del conjurador\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar la Baratija del conjurador: Pon hasta una carta objetivo de tu cementerio en la parte inferior de tu biblioteca. Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Es el momento del descubrimiento, el triunfo de la mente, la reinvención de glorias pasadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70eff486-5780-4d69-8d7e-6559e0e1fee4\', \'multiverseId\': 81078}, \'multiverseid\': 81078}, {\'name\': \'Babiole du conjurateur\', \'text\': "{T}, Sacrifiez la Babiole du conjurateur : Mettez au-dessous de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à une carte ciblée de votre cimetière. Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "C\'est l\'instant de découverte, le triomphe de l\'esprit, le rêve de la gloire passée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80748&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84be933a-58ed-4a47-98a5-ccb1cf5d6a0c\', \'multiverseId\': 80748}, \'multiverseid\': 80748}, {\'name\': "Ninnolo dell\'Evocatore", \'text\': "{T}, Sacrifica il Ninnolo dell\'Evocatore: Metti in fondo al tuo grimorio fino a una carta bersaglio presente nel tuo cimitero. Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'È il momento della scoperta, il trionfo della mente, il ritorno della gloria passata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba8a2494-6685-45bc-8501-1869b5b3b0ab\', \'multiverseId\': 81243}, \'multiverseid\': 81243}, {\'name\': \'妖術師のガラクタ\', \'text\': \'{T}, 妖術師のガラクタを生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にあるカードを最大１枚まで対象とし、それをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それは発見の瞬間であり、精神の功績であり、過去の栄光の再創造である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b268ef53-fecd-4724-9311-0ab746f558b0\', \'multiverseId\': 80583}, \'multiverseid\': 80583}, {\'name\': \'Bijuteria do Conjurador\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifique Bijuteria do Conjurador: Coloque até um card alvo de seu cemitério no fundo de seu grimório. Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'É o momento de descoberta, o triunfo da mente, a reimaginação da glória passada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46f9543c-7ade-4636-8f60-92ea5cafc540\', \'multiverseId\': 81408}, \'multiverseid\': 81408}, {\'name\': \'咒法师饰品\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲咒法师饰品：从你的坟墓场将至多一张目标牌置于你的牌库底。抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'这是发现的时刻，心灵的胜利，昔日荣光的追思。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94162fb5-76ca-48cb-94db-008074230990\', \'multiverseId\': 81573}, \'multiverseid\': 81573}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brosche des Wandersmanns\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, opfere die Brosche des Wandersmanns: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einem Standardland und bringe diese Karte getappt ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sie ist wie der Wald hinterm Horizont, wie der Berg, der noch bezwungen werden will, wie das neue Land hinter dem endlosen Meer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81041&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd2838b0-1484-4266-b9f5-16ef94466e51\', \'multiverseId\': 81041}, \'multiverseid\': 81041}, {\'name\': \'Baratija del caminante\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrificar la Baratija del caminante: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica y pon esa carta en juego girada. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Es el bosque más allá del horizonte, la montaña que espera ser escalada, la nueva tierra detrás del mar interminable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f410257a-23cc-4069-a86f-67659120f397\', \'multiverseId\': 81206}, \'multiverseid\': 81206}, {\'name\': \'Babiole du voyageur\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, Sacrifiez la Babiole du voyageur : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base et mettez cette carte en jeu engagée. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "C\'est la forêt au-delà de l\'horizon, la montagne encore vierge, la nouvelle terre au-delà de la mer éternelle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80876&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0984579-9501-4f33-b8e0-d9950e713b6a\', \'multiverseId\': 80876}, \'multiverseid\': 80876}, {\'name\': \'Ninnolo del Viaggiatore\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Ninnolo del Viaggiatore: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta terra base e metti in gioco quella carta TAPpata. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "È la foresta oltre l\'orizzonte, la montagna che attende di essere scalata, la nuova terra dall\'altra parte del mare infinito.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9191fdf3-8692-4f33-a047-6a1b1e8b313c\', \'multiverseId\': 81371}, \'multiverseid\': 81371}, {\'name\': \'旅人のガラクタ\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, 旅人のガラクタを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本地形カードを１枚探し、タップ状態で場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それは地平線の彼方の森であり、登るものを待つ山であり、終わりなき海の向こうの見果てぬ地である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42f6c23e-9af2-4660-b35f-7c027ace7771\', \'multiverseId\': 80711}, \'multiverseid\': 80711}, {\'name\': \'Bijuteria do Viajante\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, Sacrifique Bijuteria do Viajante: Procure em seu grimório por um card de terreno básico e coloque-o em jogo virado. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'É a floresta além do horizonte, a montanha à espera de escaladores, a terra nova do outro lado do mar sem fim.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5acf3115-8989-4715-8826-ecc69e27e688\', \'multiverseId\': 81536}, \'multiverseid\': 81536}, {\'name\': \'旅人饰品\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}，牺牲旅人饰品：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，并将之横置进场。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'这是地平线远处的树林，尚待征服的山脉，无尽汪洋彼端的新大地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d5a3151-f829-4f8d-b585-fb7cd4bad63f\', \'multiverseId\': 81701}, \'multiverseid\': 81701}]', '[{\'name\': \'Buboh-Vandalen\', \'text\': \'{G}, opfere die Buboh-Vandalen: Neutralisiere eine aktivierte Fähigkeit deiner Wahl aus einer Artefaktquelle und zerstöre dieses Artefakt, falls es im Spiel ist. (Manafähigkeiten können nicht als Ziel bestimmt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Buboh\', \'flavor\': \'Die Bubohs schafften es endlich, die mechanische Monstrosität lahm zu legen, als sie sich selbst in ihrem Getriebe verfingen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79decf6f-0af3-49a0-a4cb-09dec53c84e5\', \'multiverseId\': 80982}, \'multiverseid\': 80982}, {\'name\': \'Vándalos oufé\', \'text\': \'{G}, sacrificar los Vándalos oufé: Contrarresta la habilidad activada objetivo cuya fuente sea un artefacto y destruye ese artefacto si está en juego. (Las habilidades de maná no pueden hacerse objetivo.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Oufé\', \'flavor\': \'Los oufés finalmente lograron detener la monstruosidad mecánica, atravesándose ellos mismos en los engranajes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f5b9c9f-48aa-40bf-9c6f-8983f8fdacda\', \'multiverseId\': 81147}, \'multiverseid\': 81147}, {\'name\': \'Vandales orphes\', \'text\': "{G}, Sacrifiez les Vandales orphes : Contrez la capacité activée ciblée d\'une source artefact et détruisez cet artefact s\'il est en jeu. (Les capacités de mana ne peuvent pas être ciblées.)", \'type\': \'Créature : orphe\', \'flavor\': \'Les orphes finirent par immobiliser la monstruosité mécanique en se jetant dans ses rouages.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80817&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'582aa5aa-3bf3-45ba-9ce6-5556bbfff51d\', \'multiverseId\': 80817}, \'multiverseid\': 80817}, {\'name\': \'Vandali Ouphe\', \'text\': "{G}, Sacrifica i Vandali Ouphe: Neutralizza un\'abilità attivata bersaglio di una fonte artefatto e distruggi quell\'artefatto se è in gioco. (Le abilità di mana non possono essere scelte come bersaglio.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ouphe\', \'flavor\': \'Gli ouphe sono finalmente riusciti a fermare la mostruosità meccanica infilandosi tra i suoi ingranaggi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4df205eb-e5ed-45b2-8d20-691b49372f87\', \'multiverseId\': 81312}, \'multiverseid\': 81312}, {\'name\': \'アウフの蛮人\', \'text\': \'{G}, アウフの蛮人を生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクトを発生源とする起動方能力１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。そのアーティファクトが場にある場合、それを破壊する。（マナ能力は対象にできない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アウフ\', \'flavor\': \'アウフは最終的に、機械仕掛けの怪物をおとなしくする方法を見つけた。自分自身が歯車に挟まるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ddbf6bd-ed57-4713-958d-0f7cd91722ff\', \'multiverseId\': 80652}, \'multiverseid\': 80652}, {\'name\': \'Trasgos Vândalos\', \'text\': \'{G}, Sacrifique Trasgos Vândalos: Anula a habilidade ativada alvo de uma fonte artefato e destrói aquele artefato se ele estiver em jogo. (As habilidades de mana não podem ser visadas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Por fim, os trasgos conseguiram parar a monstruosidade mecânica atirando-se entre suas engrenagens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d19b4a7-4ead-4585-85a9-f72feca5fefb\', \'multiverseId\': 81477}, \'multiverseid\': 81477}, {\'name\': \'莽撞奥夫\', \'text\': \'{G}，牺牲莽撞奥夫：反击来源为神器的目标起动式异能，且如果该神器在场，便将其消灭。（其目标不能是法术力异能）\', \'type\': \'生物～奥夫\', \'flavor\': \'奥夫终于有办法把发条怪兽弄停了～他们把自己塞进齿轮里面。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d5f2d6c-3322-4cb3-88ba-be77dbd9a699\', \'multiverseId\': 81642}, \'multiverseid\': 81642}]', '[{\'name\': \'Böennavigator\', \'text\': \'Opfere ein Artefakt: Der Böennavigator erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur\', \'flavor\': \'Er hebt ab in einem Schwall aufgeheizter Luft und überrascht damit immer wieder wilde Pterons, die den Boden überwachen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81028&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c9d43c9-6bed-46f7-9543-ae31261d3f1f\', \'multiverseId\': 81028}, \'multiverseid\': 81028}, {\'name\': \'Navegador de termales\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar un artefacto: El Navegador de termales gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Despega con un rugido de viento recalentado, asustando a los pterones salvajes que estudian el terreno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36e2bcdb-332a-4cc3-95c9-722897010cc3\', \'multiverseId\': 81193}, \'multiverseid\': 81193}, {\'name\': \'Navigateur thermique\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez un artefact : Le Navigateur thermique acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Il décolle dans un rugissement de vent brûlant, effrayant les ptérons qui examinent le sol.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80863&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f9dab7a-0734-4817-82df-b07477f5e2b3\', \'multiverseId\': 80863}, \'multiverseid\': 80863}, {\'name\': \'Navigatore Termico\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica un artefatto: Il Navigatore Termico guadagna volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Si solleva con un ruggito di vento surriscaldato, spaventando gli pteron che sorvegliano il terreno sottostante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a1ec67e-5de0-4b49-a316-70c83f38a922\', \'multiverseId\': 81358}, \'multiverseid\': 81358}, {\'name\': \'熱風の操縦者\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトを１つ生け贄に捧げる：熱風の操縦者はターン終了時まで飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー\', \'flavor\': \'それは熱風を受けて飛び立ち、目下の大地を調べながら、野生の翼竜を驚かす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61448ec5-d5f1-4723-a186-f1c42285b16c\', \'multiverseId\': 80698}, \'multiverseid\': 80698}, {\'name\': \'Navegador Térmico\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique um artefato: Navegador Térmico ganha a habilidade de voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Ele decola com uma lufada de vento super-aquecido, sobressaltando os pteros selvagens que vasculham o chão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76adea6b-18aa-426b-8baa-1fc7de92790d\', \'multiverseId\': 81523}, \'multiverseid\': 81523}, {\'name\': \'热能导航机\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个神器：热能导航机获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物\', \'flavor\': \'起飞时扬起炙风巨响，惊走俯瞰地景的野生翼兽。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35f4a572-ad22-42cf-9981-36dc454af2ba\', \'multiverseId\': 81688}, \'multiverseid\': 81688}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bösartiger Verrat\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen als zusätzliche Kosten, um Bösartiger Verrat zu spielen.\\nEine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +2/+2 für jede auf diese Weise geopferte Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81037&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d13373f8-5ad9-4736-a8e3-083c7524c0ed\', \'multiverseId\': 81037}, \'multiverseid\': 81037}, {\'name\': \'Traición perversa\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para jugar la Traición perversa, sacrifica cualquier cantidad de criaturas.\\nLa criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno por cada criatura sacrificada de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581242c0-46e6-4b1f-a1d6-3e0242866290\', \'multiverseId\': 81202}, \'multiverseid\': 81202}, {\'name\': \'Trahison vicieuse\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour jouer la Trahison vicieuse, sacrifiez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures.\\nLa créature ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque créature sacrifiée de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80872&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3f57220-a93b-41a3-bffa-e39a478662d3\', \'multiverseId\': 80872}, \'multiverseid\': 80872}, {\'name\': \'Tradimento Perverso\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per giocare il Tradimento Perverso, sacrifica un qualsiasi numero di creature.\\nLa creatura bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno per ogni creatura sacrificata in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2b41f31-09cb-4e76-b4ad-91fd02fb6c3e\', \'multiverseId\': 81367}, \'multiverseid\': 81367}, {\'name\': \'不純な裏切り\', \'text\': \'不純な裏切りをプレイするための追加コストとして、望む数のクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで、これにより生け贄に捧げたクリーチャー１体につき+2/+2の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03515e4d-9d8e-498b-9efe-02cc5bec5939\', \'multiverseId\': 80707}, \'multiverseid\': 80707}, {\'name\': \'Traição Odiosa\', \'text\': \'Como um custo adicional para jogar Traição Odiosa, sacrifique um número qualquer de criaturas.\\nA criatura alvo recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno para cada criatura sacrificada desta maneira.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40508300-e64c-4116-bdd5-4bc4c6550c5b\', \'multiverseId\': 81532}, \'multiverseid\': 81532}, {\'name\': \'恶毒叛行\', \'text\': \'牺牲任意数量的生物，以作为使用恶毒叛行的额外费用。\\n每以此法牺牲一个生物，目标生物便得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9ef2fc5-ae99-48e5-acbb-2e7e1ffb4be4\', \'multiverseId\': 81697}, \'multiverseid\': 81697}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chimärenspulen\', \'text\': \'{X}{1}: Die Chimärenspulen werden zu einer X/X Artefaktkreatur. Opfere sie am Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Energie, die die Ringe mit Leben erfüllt, schmilzt sie gleichzeitig hinweg und hinterlässt nur Schlackehäufchen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80907&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'992de79c-3189-4afc-8291-0fdf9c173288\', \'multiverseId\': 80907}, \'multiverseid\': 80907}, {\'name\': \'Bobinas quiméricas\', \'text\': \'{X}{1}: Las Bobinas quiméricas se convierten en una criatura artefacto X/X. Sacrifícalas al final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'La energía que da vida a los anillos también los funde, dejando sólo charcos de escoria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e80c268-1c88-48b5-8138-c94953138e3f\', \'multiverseId\': 81072}, \'multiverseid\': 81072}, {\'name\': \'Annelures chimériques\', \'text\': \'{X}{1} : Les Annelures chimériques deviennent une créature-artefact X/X. Sacrifiez-les à la fin du tour.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'énergie qui donne vie aux anneaux les transforme aussi en flaques de métal en fusion inutilisables.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80742&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'973e6b19-0b7d-41f0-b871-9ae9675f1700\', \'multiverseId\': 80742}, \'multiverseid\': 80742}, {\'name\': \'Spirali Chimeriche\', \'text\': \'{X}{1}: Le Spirali Chimeriche diventano una creatura artefatto X/X. Sacrificale alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "L\'energia che permea di vita gli anelli li fa anche fondere, lasciando solo inutili pozze di scorie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bb469be-4da1-4fc9-919b-fe5a6cac534e\', \'multiverseId\': 81237}, \'multiverseid\': 81237}, {\'name\': \'キマイラ・コイル\', \'text\': \'{X}{1}：キマイラ・コイルはX/Xのアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。ターン終了時にそれを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'輪に生命をもたらすべく注入されたエネルギーは、一方でそれを溶かしてしまう。あとに残るのは使えない屑鉄の塊だけだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67711e75-10fd-4be8-a1d3-72ed2c78e8a5\', \'multiverseId\': 80577}, \'multiverseid\': 80577}, {\'name\': \'Espirais Quiméricas\', \'text\': \'{X}{1}: Espirais Quiméricas torna-se uma criatura artefato X/X. Sacrifique-a no final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'A energia que instila vida nos anéis também os derrete, deixando apenas montes inúteis de escória.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1cc37a8-6f2c-4fed-92a5-23ffe0fc8778\', \'multiverseId\': 81402}, \'multiverseid\': 81402}, {\'name\': \'盖美拉盘卷\', \'text\': \'{X}{1}：盖美拉盘卷成为X/X的神器生物。在回合结束时将之牺牲。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'注入环间的生命能量同时使其融解，最终只剩熔渣数滩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff869ebf-af4a-458c-9fdf-c8adc4c69964\', \'multiverseId\': 81567}, \'multiverseid\': 81567}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Hoffnung verlieren\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nHellsicht 2 (Betrachte die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek. Lege eine beliebige Anzahl davon in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek und den Rest oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac85313a-514d-413e-91cd-c94e52001d94\', \'multiverseId\': 80965}, \'multiverseid\': 80965}, {\'name\': \'Perder la esperanza\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\\nAdivinar 2 (Mira las dos primeras cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca. Pon cualquier número de ellas en la parte inferior de tu biblioteca y el resto, en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0042e601-467a-488e-8faa-b8d1be5d97a2\', \'multiverseId\': 81130}, \'multiverseid\': 81130}, {\'name\': \'Perdre espoir\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nRegard 2 (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste, au-dessus, dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80800&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb4a21a1-97ed-4b83-9943-93d007becf52\', \'multiverseId\': 80800}, \'multiverseid\': 80800}, {\'name\': \'Perdere la Speranza\', \'text\': "La creatura bersaglio prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\\nProfetizzare 2 (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Metti un qualsiasi numero di esse in fondo al tuo grimorio e le rimanenti in cima a esso nell\'ordine che preferisci.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04f8ca24-0907-4279-8bd0-0a5eaa7bb8e2\', \'multiverseId\': 81295}, \'multiverseid\': 81295}, {\'name\': \'希望の喪失\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで-1/-1の修整を受ける。\\n占術 ２ （あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを見る。そのうち望む枚数をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを一番上に、望む順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66a6a367-3cca-416d-be63-45d7d5ba1741\', \'multiverseId\': 80635}, \'multiverseid\': 80635}, {\'name\': \'Perder a Esperança\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -1/-1 até o final do turno.\\nVidência 2 (Olhe os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque qualquer número deles no fundo de seu grimório e o restante no topo em qualquer ordem.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2f0b1cc-e590-4f33-b766-4a12647be4ab\', \'multiverseId\': 81460}, \'multiverseid\': 81460}, {\'name\': \'丧失希望\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。\\n占卜2（检视你牌库顶的两张牌。将其中任意数量的牌置于你牌库底，其余则置于你牌库顶；你决定牌的顺序。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccbb149a-65ef-4d49-b820-d67160a7d2c6\', \'multiverseId\': 81625}, \'multiverseid\': 81625}]', "[{'name': 'Dosierter Sprengstoff', 'text': 'Sonneneruption (Diese Karte kommt für jede unterschiedliche Manafarbe, die beim Bezahlen ihrer Kosten verwendet wurde, mit einer Ladungsmarke ins Spiel.)\\n{2}, opfere den Dosierten Sprengstoff: Zerstöre alle bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind und deren umgewandelte Manakosten gleich der Anzahl der Ladungsmarken auf dem Dosierten Sprengstoff ist.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80928&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2fde5a54-e40c-4daf-8898-2f2507a56a4c', 'multiverseId': 80928}, 'multiverseid': 80928}, {'name': 'Explosivos diseñados', 'text': 'Estallido solar (Esto entra en juego con un contador de carga sobre él por cada color de maná usado para pagar su coste.)\\n{2}, sacrificar los Explosivos diseñados: Destruye cada permanente que no sea tierra con coste de maná convertido igual al número de contadores de carga sobre los Explosivos diseñados.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81093&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a5200d3-94f2-406e-803e-aadfd95c6c7c', 'multiverseId': 81093}, 'multiverseid': 81093}, {'name': 'Explosifs artificiels', 'text': 'Solarisation (Cette carte arrive en jeu avec, sur elle, un marqueur « charge » pour chaque couleur de mana utilisée pour payer son coût.)\\n{2}, Sacrifiez les Explosifs artificiels : Détruisez chaque permanent non-terrain ayant un coût converti de mana égal au nombre de marqueurs « charge » sur les Explosifs artificiels.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80763&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2ad020b-8fe2-4a31-be4e-4107b7b5be00', 'multiverseId': 80763}, 'multiverseid': 80763}, {'name': 'Esplosivi Ingegnerizzati', 'text': 'Solarizzazione (Questa carta entra in gioco con un segnalino carica per ogni colore di mana usato per pagare il suo costo.)\\n{2}, Sacrifica gli Esplosivi Ingegnerizzati: Distruggi ogni permanente non terra con costo di mana convertito pari al numero di segnalini carica presenti sugli Esplosivi Ingegnerizzati.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81258&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4836538a-9a1e-4bbd-8e05-003051dc1440', 'multiverseId': 81258}, 'multiverseid': 81258}, {'name': '仕組まれた爆薬', 'text': '烈日 （これのコストのために支払われたマナの色１色につき１個の蓄積カウンターが置かれた状態で場に出る。）\\n{2}, 仕組まれた爆薬を生け贄に捧げる：仕組まれた爆薬の上に置かれた蓄積カウンターの数と同じ点数で見たマナ・コストを持つすべての土地でないパーマネントを破壊する。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80598&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '180e3289-f80e-43a9-be74-9800d7bcdc48', 'multiverseId': 80598}, 'multiverseid': 80598}, {'name': 'Explosivos Fabricados', 'text': 'Facho Solar (Este card entra em jogo com um marcador de carga para cada cor de mana usada para pagar seu custo.)\\n{2}, Sacrifique Explosivos Fabricados: Destrói cada permanente que não seja um terreno cujo custo de mana convertido seja igual ao número de marcadores de carga em Explosivos Fabricados.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81423&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86e588ea-52e9-4afb-8a69-92a45f164b24', 'multiverseId': 81423}, 'multiverseid': 81423}, {'name': '密设爆裂物', 'text': '辉映（用过几种颜色的法术力来支付其费用，它进场时上面便有几个充电指示物。）\\n{2}，牺牲密设爆裂物：消灭所有非地，且总法术力费用等于密设爆裂物上充电指示物数量的永久物。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81588&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdf7fa52-f883-418a-be6c-82ef8bc601ae', 'multiverseId': 81588}, 'multiverseid': 81588}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ebenholzsceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler einen Zauberspruch spielt, verlierst du 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': \'Die gefährlichsten Mörder dienen nur denjenigen, die keine Angst vor dem Sterben haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80925&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'327dfc9f-4338-48b3-bbfd-19599f852604\', \'multiverseId\': 80925}, \'multiverseid\': 80925}, {\'name\': \'Draco de ébano\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que un jugador juegue un hechizo, pierdes 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': \'Los asesinos más mortales sirven sólo a aquellos que no temen morir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'437105ba-72b1-459d-b5f6-322613db4c4f\', \'multiverseId\': 81090}, \'multiverseid\': 81090}, {\'name\': "Drakôn d\'ébène", \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur joue un sort, vous perdez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': "Les tueurs les plus dangereux servent ceux qui n\'ont pas peur de mourir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80760&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6b745ed-45cc-46f6-95e7-3f4e77d8e5e4\', \'multiverseId\': 80760}, \'multiverseid\': 80760}, {\'name\': "Draghetto d\'Ebano", \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore gioca una magia, perdi 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': \'Gli assassini più letali servono solo coloro che non hanno paura di morire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4d73c91-ed07-4e21-9bec-75cecde25d6e\', \'multiverseId\': 81255}, \'multiverseid\': 81255}, {\'name\': \'漆黒のドレイク\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nいずれかのプレイヤーが呪文をプレイするたび、あなたは１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': \'最強の殺し屋は、死をも恐れない者にのみ仕える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15e34cd4-93ba-44d7-81db-d08576e5f6f7\', \'multiverseId\': 80595}, \'multiverseid\': 80595}, {\'name\': \'Dragonete de Ébano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que um jogador jogar uma mágica, você perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragonete\', \'flavor\': \'Os melhores assassinos servem apenas aos que não temem a morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88142901-9a77-483e-a46f-d28ec6e0143d\', \'multiverseId\': 81420}, \'multiverseid\': 81420}, {\'name\': \'黑檀龙兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当牌手使用咒语时，你失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙兽\', \'flavor\': \'不把命当一回事的人，才有资格使役最致命的杀手。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'028746f7-d400-491d-8df1-c1556c987f50\', \'multiverseId\': 81585}, \'multiverseid\': 81585}]', '[{\'name\': \'Edelsteinreihe\', \'text\': \'{2}: Lege eine Ladungsmarke auf die Edelsteinreihe.\\nEntferne eine Ladungsmarke von der Edelsteinreihe: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Nach außen reflektiert sie das Licht der Sonnen. Doch im Innern erntet sie deren Macht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80943&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c4bb0f9-9b9b-4120-aea7-0793355c84cc\', \'multiverseId\': 80943}, \'multiverseid\': 80943}, {\'name\': \'Matriz de gemas\', \'text\': \'{2}: Pon un contador de carga en la Matriz de gemas.\\nRemover un contador de carga de la Matriz de gemas: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Por fuera, refleja la luz de los soles. Por dentro, cosecha su poder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'110f7a19-592c-40d5-9054-7e0cb0a62683\', \'multiverseId\': 81108}, \'multiverseid\': 81108}, {\'name\': \'Déploiement de gemmes\', \'text\': \'{2} : Mettez un marqueur « charge » sur le Déploiement de gemmes.\\nRetirez un marqueur « charge » du Déploiement de gemmes : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Dehors, il reflète la lumière des soleils. Dedans, il absorbe leur puissance.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80778&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db7d5e3e-a9e5-4b1b-9579-a5fec8089a1d\', \'multiverseId\': 80778}, \'multiverseid\': 80778}, {\'name\': \'Esposizione di Gemme\', \'text\': "{2}: Metti un segnalino carica sull\'Esposizione di Gemme.\\nRimuovi un segnalino carica dall\'Esposizione di Gemme: Aggiungi un mana di qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "All\'esterno riflette la luce dei soli. All\'interno ne immagazzina il potere.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ea279bd-2681-4a3f-982f-99c6f225defd\', \'multiverseId\': 81273}, \'multiverseid\': 81273}, {\'name\': \'宝石の陣列\', \'text\': \'{2}：宝石の陣列の上に蓄積カウンターを１個置く。\\n宝石の陣列の上から蓄積カウンターを１個取り除く：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'外側では太陽の光を反射し、内側では太陽の力を集める。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3aedc7f4-2324-4a25-b6b8-741beb497e6d\', \'multiverseId\': 80613}, \'multiverseid\': 80613}, {\'name\': \'Arranjo de Pedras Preciosas\', \'text\': \'{2}: Coloque um marcador de carga em Arranjo de Pedras Preciosas.\\nRemova um marcador de carga de Arranjo de Pedras Preciosas: Adiciona uma mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Por fora, reflete a luz do sol. Por dentro, colhe o poder do sol.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25290c3d-8719-41f4-aded-20dec4ef3e33\', \'multiverseId\': 81438}, \'multiverseid\': 81438}, {\'name\': \'宝石饰列\', \'text\': \'{2}：在宝石饰列上放置一个充电指示物。\\n从宝石饰列上移去一个充电指示物：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'外部映射太阳明光，内部储藏诸日能量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdb6084f-4da8-463e-8ca3-b43bc1150cbc\', \'multiverseId\': 81603}, \'multiverseid\': 81603}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ei des Beschwörers\', \'text\': \'Einprägen Wenn das Ei des Beschwörers ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte aus deiner Hand verdeckt ganz aus dem Spiel entfernen.\\nWenn das Ei des Beschwörers aus dem Spiel auf den Friedhof gelegt wird, decke die eingeprägte verdeckte Karte auf. Ist diese Karte eine Kreaturenkarte, bringe sie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81019&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b407235-7b55-4517-816a-5702e02bf613\', \'multiverseId\': 81019}, \'multiverseid\': 81019}, {\'name\': \'Huevo del invocador\', \'text\': \'Estampa Cuando el Huevo del invocador entre en juego, puedes remover del juego boca abajo una carta de tu mano.\\nCuando el Huevo del invocador vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, voltea la carta estampada boca arriba. Si es una carta de criatura, ponla en juego bajo tu control.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b0a6fd5-401d-4be3-8c9c-679c4299747c\', \'multiverseId\': 81184}, \'multiverseid\': 81184}, {\'name\': "Œuf de l\'invocateur", \'text\': "Empreinte Quand l\'Œuf de l\'invocateur arrive en jeu, vous pouvez retirer de la partie, face cachée, une carte de votre main.\\nQuand l\'Œuf de l\'invocateur est mis dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, retournez face visible la carte dont il a l\'empreinte. Si cette carte est une carte de créature, mettez-la en jeu sous votre contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80854&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea66d43c-6cfb-44b2-a750-99ad72cb367e\', \'multiverseId\': 80854}, \'multiverseid\': 80854}, {\'name\': "Uovo dell\'Evocatore", \'text\': "Imprimere Quando l\'Uovo dell\'Evocatore entra in gioco, puoi rimuovere dal gioco a faccia in giù una carta presente nella tua mano.\\nQuando l\'Uovo dell\'Evocatore viene messo in un cimitero dal gioco, gira a faccia in su la carta impressa a faccia in giù. Se quella carta è una carta creatura, mettila in gioco sotto il tuo controllo.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'739be04d-9454-4b09-a3ff-100fd28143de\', \'multiverseId\': 81349}, \'multiverseid\': 81349}, {\'name\': \'召喚者の卵\', \'text\': \'刻印 ― 召喚者の卵が場に出たとき、あなたは自分の手札にあるカードを１枚、裏向きにゲームから取り除いてもよい。\\n召喚者の卵が場から墓地に置かれたとき、刻印されている裏向きのカードを表向きにする。それがクリーチャー･カードである場合、それをあなたのコントロール下で場に出す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44626252-0ad5-4466-b268-97d7accf54b4\', \'multiverseId\': 80689}, \'multiverseid\': 80689}, {\'name\': \'Ovo do Invocador\', \'text\': \'Estampar Quando Ovo do Invocador entra em jogo, você pode remover de jogo, com a face para baixo, um card de sua mão. (O card removido fica estampado neste artefato.)\\nQuando Ovo do Invocador for colocado num cemitério vindo de jogo, volte com a face para cima o card estampado com a face para baixo. Se o card for um card de criatura, coloque-o em jogo sob o seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d12c423-55a7-4ac2-ac0a-a86ee6089d7d\', \'multiverseId\': 81514}, \'multiverseid\': 81514}, {\'name\': \'召唤师封卵\', \'text\': \'压印～当召唤师封卵进场时，你可以将一张牌从你手上面朝下地移出对战。（被移出对战的牌压印在此神器上）\\n当召唤师封卵从场上进入坟墓场时，将所压印的牌面朝下之牌翻回正面。若该牌是生物牌，则将该牌在你的操控下放置进场。\', \'type\': \'神器生物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68884caf-ad7c-4c85-b6ac-0405f57b0116\', \'multiverseId\': 81679}, \'multiverseid\': 81679}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eingebung des Handwerkers\', \'text\': \'{U}, wirf eine Artefaktkarte aus deiner Hand ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Artefaktkarte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 1 oder weniger, zeige diese Karte offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80885&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38ce85ba-d95e-4b08-a5a2-36ba1879bf4e\', \'multiverseId\': 80885}, \'multiverseid\': 80885}, {\'name\': \'Intuición del artífice\', \'text\': \'{U}, descartar una carta de artefacto de tu mano: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de artefacto con coste de maná convertido de 1 o menos, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01645d19-cd5b-4e8c-ad72-f51a49a36e02\', \'multiverseId\': 81050}, \'multiverseid\': 81050}, {\'name\': "Intuition de l\'artificier", \'text\': "{U}, Défaussez-vous d\'une carte d\'artefact de votre main : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'artefact avec un coût converti de mana de 1 ou moins, révélez-la et mettez-la dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80720&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e7b97e1-7a41-43a8-995d-c3a2a31e764c\', \'multiverseId\': 80720}, \'multiverseid\': 80720}, {\'name\': "Intuito dell\'Artefice", \'text\': \'{U}, Scarta una carta artefatto dalla tua mano: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta artefatto con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 1, rivela quella carta e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8207eeda-89db-456b-9356-ea505e35e2c8\', \'multiverseId\': 81215}, \'multiverseid\': 81215}, {\'name\': \'工匠の直感\', \'text\': \'{U}, あなたの手札からアーティファクト・カードを１枚捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから、点数でみたマナ・コストが１以下のアーティファクト・カードを１枚探し、そのカードを公開してあなたの手札に加える。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント（場）\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c859927d-fc30-4f31-a5f1-c4a37083b3a8\', \'multiverseId\': 80555}, \'multiverseid\': 80555}, {\'name\': \'Intuição do Artesão\', \'text\': \'{U}, Descarte um card de artefato de sua mão: Procure em seu grimório por um card de artefato com custo de mana convertido menor ou igual a 1, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98773817-86a3-4179-933d-984c9f7d416e\', \'multiverseId\': 81380}, \'multiverseid\': 81380}, {\'name\': \'神器师的直觉\', \'text\': \'{U}，从你手上弃掉一张神器牌：从你的牌库中搜寻一张总法术力费用等于或小于1的神器牌，展示该牌，并置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e80318f1-01be-4e25-b495-db28b492b691\', \'multiverseId\': 81545}, \'multiverseid\': 81545}]', "[{'name': 'Eisenhütte des Krark-Clans', 'text': 'Opfere ein Artefakt: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {2}.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Der ganze Plunder, Ausschuss und Schund des Krark-Clans wird eifrig aufgesammelt, eingeschmolzen und zu mehr Plunder, Ausschuss und Schund verarbeitet.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80961&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1d92946-0fb9-4109-9347-fc9135861d29', 'multiverseId': 80961}, 'multiverseid': 80961}, {'name': 'Herrería del clan Krark', 'text': 'Sacrificar un artefacto: Agrega {2} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Toda la basura, desperdicios y sobras del clan Krark es cuidadosamente recolectada, fundida y convertida en más basura, desperdicios y sobras.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81126&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be410869-d08f-46d0-b287-76978e014223', 'multiverseId': 81126}, 'multiverseid': 81126}, {'name': 'Ferronnerie du clan Krark', 'text': 'Sacrifiez un artefact : Ajoutez {2} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'Les déchets, les ferrailles et même les déjections du clan Krark sont récoltés, fondus et reforgés pour devenir de futurs déchets, de futures ferrailles et de futures déjections.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80796&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a78a925-96a8-479c-87fd-bc324b827eb5', 'multiverseId': 80796}, 'multiverseid': 80796}, {'name': 'Ferriera di Krark-Clan', 'text': 'Sacrifica un artefatto: Aggiungi {2} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Tutti i rifiuti, il ciarpame e gli scarti del Krark-Clan vengono raccolti diligentemente, fusi e trasformati in altri rifiuti, ciarpame e scarti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81291&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8c2b597-3352-46c0-b163-e4ca4495075b', 'multiverseId': 81291}, 'multiverseid': 81291}, {'name': 'クラーク族の鉄工所', 'text': 'アーティファクトを１つ生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{2}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'クラーク族のガラクタやゴミや屑鉄は丁寧にまとめられ、溶かされ、さらなるガラクタやゴミや屑鉄となる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80631&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b55a49ba-ce25-40d7-8464-a5dd523abc8d', 'multiverseId': 80631}, 'multiverseid': 80631}, {'name': 'Fundição do Clã-de-Krark', 'text': 'Sacrifique um artefato: Adiciona {2} à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': 'Toda a sucata, escória e lixo do Clã de Krark são diligentemente recolhidos, derretidos e transformados em mais sucata, escória e lixo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81456&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7256ea02-45d0-483e-b091-d671adacb387', 'multiverseId': 81456}, 'multiverseid': 81456}, {'name': '喀勒克族制铁厂', 'text': '牺牲一个神器：加{2}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '喀勒克族勤于收集该族的垃圾、劣品和废料，全部熔解，再作成更多垃圾、劣品和废料。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81621&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11da0e32-5ab8-4a53-a9e6-5c65baf65d13', 'multiverseId': 81621}, 'multiverseid': 81621}]", "[{'name': 'Eisenstachelraupe', 'text': 'Eile\\nDie Eisenstachelraupe kann nicht blocken.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Bestie', 'flavor': 'Wenn du ein Erbeben des Bodens spürst, verhalte dich ganz ruhig. Ein einziger Laut reicht aus, um die Raupe anzulocken.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80958&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1ec7638-aa01-4c0c-939d-a7e6dfcd3d7b', 'multiverseId': 80958}, 'multiverseid': 80958}, {'name': 'Diablo espinas de acero', 'text': 'Prisa.\\nEl Diablo espinas de acero no puede bloquear.', 'type': 'Criatura — Bestia', 'flavor': 'Cuando sientas vibrar el suelo, quédate inmóvil. El más mínimo sonido atraerá al diablo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81123&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4022e55b-c1cd-4d0c-befb-14dbcefc105f', 'multiverseId': 81123}, 'multiverseid': 81123}, {'name': 'Monstruosité de fer barbelé', 'text': 'Célérité\\nLa Monstruosité de fer barbelé ne peut pas bloquer.', 'type': 'Créature : bête', 'flavor': 'Quand vous sentez le sol trembler, restez immobile. Le moindre bruit attire la monstruosité.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80793&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61c42012-fad7-4dd4-9225-bafbc4c3d63b', 'multiverseId': 80793}, 'multiverseid': 80793}, {'name': 'Ferrospinato Infernale', 'text': 'Rapidità\\nIl Ferrospinato Infernale non può bloccare.', 'type': 'Creatura — Bestia', 'flavor': 'Quando avverti un tremito nel terreno, resta assolutamente immobile. Basta un lieve rumore per richiamare il ferrospinato.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81288&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3cdaaeb9-e9d3-46c2-b71d-747674b07277', 'multiverseId': 81288}, 'multiverseid': 81288}, {'name': '鉄棘の乱暴者', 'text': '速攻\\n鉄棘の乱暴者はブロックに参加できない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': '地鳴りを感じたら、とにかく完璧におとなしくしてろ。ちょっとでも音を立てれば、乱暴者が襲いに来るぞ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80628&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d1f3e70-fda7-4480-a456-206954621e87', 'multiverseId': 80628}, 'multiverseid': 80628}, {'name': 'Fera Avernal Ferrifarpada', 'text': 'Ímpeto\\nFera Avernal Ferrifarpada não pode bloquear.', 'type': 'Criatura — Besta', 'flavor': 'Quando sentires tremer o chão, pare, de prontidão. Pois se um único ruído ouvir, a fera avernal irá surgir.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81453&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8f5d433-e458-4627-943e-8fb1373496a1', 'multiverseId': 81453}, 'multiverseid': 81453}, {'name': '铁钩地狱兽', 'text': '敏捷\\n铁钩地狱兽不能进行阻挡。', 'type': '生物～野兽', 'flavor': '若感觉地面隆隆作响，务必定身不动。只要一出声，地狱兽随后就到。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81618&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '255b5f60-4dec-4e0e-b96e-e81de71394a1', 'multiverseId': 81618}, 'multiverseid': 81618}]", '[{\'name\': \'Endloses Flüstern\', \'text\': \'Jede Kreatur hat „Wenn diese Kreatur aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bestimme einen Gegner deiner Wahl. Dieser Spieler bringt am Ende des Zuges diese Kreaturenkarte aus diesem Friedhof unter seiner Kontrolle ins Spiel."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Wer im Schatten der schwarzen Sonne den Tod antrifft, kann seiner Anziehung nicht widerstehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bdbf944-812e-440c-9a74-51197c5aae4f\', \'multiverseId\': 80926}, \'multiverseid\': 80926}, {\'name\': \'Susurros interminables\', \'text\': \'Cada criatura tiene "Cuando esta criatura vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, elige un oponente objetivo. Ese jugador pone en juego bajo su control esta carta de criatura de ese cementerio al final del turno."\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Aquellos que encuentran la muerte bajo la sombra del sol negro no pueden escapar de su atracción.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bf6739e-dbb6-4144-8c98-e6021482440f\', \'multiverseId\': 81091}, \'multiverseid\': 81091}, {\'name\': \'Chuchotements interminables\', \'text\': "Chaque créature a « Quand cette créature est mise dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, choisissez l\'adversaire ciblé. Ce joueur met en jeu cette carte, sous son contrôle, depuis ce cimetière à la fin du tour. »", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Quiconque trouve la mort à l\'ombre du soleil noir ne peut résister à son appel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80761&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b342df15-31ec-4b93-88eb-5a468dba924e\', \'multiverseId\': 80761}, \'multiverseid\': 80761}, {\'name\': \'Sussurri Infiniti\', \'text\': \'Ciascuna creatura ha "Quando questa creatura viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, scegli un avversario bersaglio. Quel giocatore mette in gioco sotto il proprio controllo questa carta creatura da quel cimitero alla fine del turno."\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "Coloro che trovano la morte all\'ombra del sole nero non possono fuggirne il richiamo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4a93cfc-2257-4f95-93de-892e2285f419\', \'multiverseId\': 81256}, \'multiverseid\': 81256}, {\'name\': \'終わりなき囁き\', \'text\': \'各クリーチャーは、「このクリーチャーが場からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。ターン終了時に、そのプレイヤーはこのクリーチャー・カードをその墓地からそのプレイヤーのコントロール下で場に出す。」の能力を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント（場）\', \'flavor\': \'黒の太陽の影の下で死とまみえた者は、そこから逃れる術を持たない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2c160a4-3f8f-43c6-9ebe-b7d49abe1861\', \'multiverseId\': 80596}, \'multiverseid\': 80596}, {\'name\': \'Sussurros Intermináveis\', \'text\': \'Cada criatura tem "Quando esta criatura for colocada num cemitério vinda de jogo, escolha um oponente alvo. O jogador escolhido coloca este card de criatura daquele cemitério em jogo sob seu próprio controle."\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os que encontram a morte sob a sombra do sol preto não escapam ao seu chamado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e4b5ef1-1659-4689-b777-c7a6454b472a\', \'multiverseId\': 81421}, \'multiverseid\': 81421}, {\'name\': \'无尽细语\', \'text\': \'所有生物具有「当此生物从场上进入坟墓场时，选择目标对手。在回合结束时，该牌手将此生物牌从该坟墓场移回场上，并由他操控。」\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'于黑日玄影下丧命者，永将受其掌握。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41aef415-1bae-42d9-93ca-27f00c1e2680\', \'multiverseId\': 81586}, \'multiverseid\': 81586}]', '[{\'name\': \'Energiekammer\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eines Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Artefaktkreatur deiner Wahl; oder lege eine Ladungsmarke auf ein Nichtkreaturartefakt deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80927&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5d45348-d875-4756-9766-789c70c38f62\', \'multiverseId\': 80927}, \'multiverseid\': 80927}, {\'name\': \'Cámara de energía\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, elige uno: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura artefacto objetivo; o pon un contador de carga sobre el artefacto objetivo que no sea criatura.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d397e56-7b8c-4f4b-bfd7-014ce34a30a2\', \'multiverseId\': 81092}, \'multiverseid\': 81092}, {\'name\': "Chambre d\'énergie", \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, choisissez l\'un Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature-artefact ciblée ; ou mettez un marqueur « charge » sur l\'artefact non-créature ciblé.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80762&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66f94fa7-ab7f-4d1e-ad4e-70d5c5084fa1\', \'multiverseId\': 80762}, \'multiverseid\': 80762}, {\'name\': "Camera dell\'Energia", \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, scegli una delle opzioni seguenti Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura artefatto bersaglio; oppure metti un segnalino carica su un artefatto non creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fa8c2aa-447a-4c82-938b-208642fc5e1d\', \'multiverseId\': 81257}, \'multiverseid\': 81257}, {\'name\': \'エネルギー室\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、以下の２つから１つを選ぶ。「アーティファクト・クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に+1/+1カウンターを１個置く。」「クリーチャーでないアーティファクト１つを対象とし、それの上に蓄積カウンターを１個置く。」\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27bd995f-4d58-40f0-8244-44a6c8e7735f\', \'multiverseId\': 80597}, \'multiverseid\': 80597}, {\'name\': \'Câmara de Energia\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, escolha um Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura artefato alvo; ou coloque um marcador de carga no artefato alvo que não seja uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deb1ae52-3b50-41e1-9a14-8f828f83ccab\', \'multiverseId\': 81422}, \'multiverseid\': 81422}, {\'name\': \'能量回廊\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，选择一项～在目标神器生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物；或在目标非生物的神器上放置一个充电指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4d0df0c-3c0e-418f-9c6e-4f457ead7af6\', \'multiverseId\': 81587}, \'multiverseid\': 81587}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entweihungselementar\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Furcht.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler einen Zauberspruch spielt, opfere eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Es lässt seine kostbaren Leichen wie Marionetten tanzen, um seine Beute hirnlose Nim anzulocken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80918&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'801edd44-4ce8-4224-bae8-e346d2db11ef\', \'multiverseId\': 80918}, \'multiverseid\': 80918}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de profanación\', \'text\': \'Inspirar temor.\\nSiempre que un jugador juegue un hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Sus valiosos cadáveres bailan como marionetas para atraer a sus presas nim.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47289e5c-2064-4cf7-b8e2-4cbc63dc1701\', \'multiverseId\': 81083}, \'multiverseid\': 81083}, {\'name\': \'Élémental de profanation\', \'text\': "Peur\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur joue un sort, sacrifiez une créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': \'Ses précieux cadavres dansent comme des pantins désarticulés pour attirer les nims.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80753&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ba0602-7c6b-49d9-99a5-16aafba7548f\', \'multiverseId\': 80753}, \'multiverseid\': 80753}, {\'name\': \'Elementale Profanatore\', \'text\': \'Paura\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore gioca una magia, sacrifica una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'I suoi preziosi corpi danzano come marionette per attirare le incuranti prede nim.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67b868b2-3538-4c32-a77d-54e33865a740\', \'multiverseId\': 81248}, \'multiverseid\': 81248}, {\'name\': \'冒涜の精霊\', \'text\': \'畏怖\\nいずれかのプレイヤーが呪文をプレイするたび、あなたはクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'それは死体を人形のように踊らせ、思考の無い屍賊を餌として引き寄せる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39acdd92-813b-4226-914e-c4f563825c16\', \'multiverseId\': 80588}, \'multiverseid\': 80588}, {\'name\': \'Elemental da Profanação\', \'text\': \'Amedrontar\\nToda vez que um jogador jogar uma mágica, sacrifique uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Seus cadáveres preciosos dançam como fantoches para atrair e caçar nims descuidados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf795311-b17d-49b4-afee-c07e9f45daf5\', \'multiverseId\': 81413}, \'multiverseid\': 81413}, {\'name\': \'渎圣元素\', \'text\': \'恐惧\\n每当牌手使用咒语时，牺牲一个生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'它操弄的死尸如傀儡般舞动着，藉以诱捕无脑可思考的泞族。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32312eaa-cd9c-470e-ac6e-eab140d8b7c1\', \'multiverseId\': 81578}, \'multiverseid\': 81578}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ewige Zeugin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Ewige Zeugin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurücknehmen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Sie erinnert sich an jedes gesprochene Wort, vom Eid des Helden bis zum Schrei des Säuglings.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80932&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6648f515-71df-4d20-905d-9a7ad42792a5\', \'multiverseId\': 80932}, \'multiverseid\': 80932}, {\'name\': \'Testigo eterna\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Testigo eterna entre en juego, puedes regresar la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'Recuerda cada palabra mencionada, desde el juramento del héroe al llanto del bebé.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08b315ef-e31b-433d-a0da-3406a1c75eaf\', \'multiverseId\': 81097}, \'multiverseid\': 81097}, {\'name\': \'Témoin éternel\', \'text\': \'Quand le Témoin éternel arrive en jeu, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'Elle se souvient de chaque parole prononcée, du premier cri du bébé au serment du héros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80767&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2536c22-693b-431a-9228-328a5df39caa\', \'multiverseId\': 80767}, \'multiverseid\': 80767}, {\'name\': \'Testimone Eterna\', \'text\': \'Quando la Testimone Eterna entra in gioco, puoi riprendere in mano una carta bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': "Ricorda ogni parola che sia mai stata pronunciata, dal giuramento dell\'eroe al vagito di un bimbo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29b93a7d-f94a-4fab-8ff3-9e2624294ab1\', \'multiverseId\': 81262}, \'multiverseid\': 81262}, {\'name\': \'永遠の証人\', \'text\': \'永遠の証人が場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は語られたすべての言葉を覚えている。それは英雄の誓いから、赤ん坊の泣き声にまで至る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08398f1d-492d-4326-ae78-a2f0cd682d68\', \'multiverseId\': 80602}, \'multiverseid\': 80602}, {\'name\': \'Testemunha Eterna\', \'text\': \'Quando Testemunha Eterna entra em jogo, você pode devolver o card alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Xamã Humano\', \'flavor\': \'Ela se lembra de cada palavra proferida, do juramento do herói ao choro do bebê.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5c042fc-8b66-44e3-985b-d6a329328d7b\', \'multiverseId\': 81427}, \'multiverseid\': 81427}, {\'name\': \'不朽见证人\', \'text\': \'当不朽见证人进场时，你可以将目标牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'从英雄誓词以至婴儿哭啼，曾被言说的每字每句均永志其心。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bb54199-0200-47f8-b85b-8915dd2554f0\', \'multiverseId\': 81592}, \'multiverseid\': 81592}]', '[{\'name\': \'Falte im Äther\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Falls du dies tust, kann der Beherrscher dieses Zauberspruchs eine Kreaturenkarte aus seiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ätherportale wehen über Mirrodins Oberfläche und ziehen dabei Kreaturen durch Zeit und Raum.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80941&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0dfa734-62c8-4b64-b1ca-26faee81241d\', \'multiverseId\': 80941}, \'multiverseid\': 80941}, {\'name\': \'Plegar hacia el éter\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Si lo haces, el controlador de ese hechizo puede poner en juego una carta de criatura de su mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los portales al éter flotan sobre la superficie de Mirrodin, arrastrando criaturas a través del tiempo y el espacio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04e241d1-bc36-497d-ac17-780bbefed042\', \'multiverseId\': 81106}, \'multiverseid\': 81106}, {\'name\': "Repli dans l\'Aether", \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé. Si vous faites ainsi, le contrôleur de ce sort peut mettre en jeu une carte de créature de sa main.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les portails d\'Aether glissent à la surface de Mirrodin, projetant les créatures dans l\'espace et le temps.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80776&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65bd7325-4f90-427b-b867-d88ab547f629\', \'multiverseId\': 80776}, \'multiverseid\': 80776}, {\'name\': "Avviluppare nell\'Etere", \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. Se lo fai, il controllore di quella magia può mettere in gioco una carta creatura dalla propria mano.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'I portali eterei vanno alla deriva lungo la superficie di Mirrodin, trascinando le creature nel tempo e nello spazio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80788769-4778-4466-8d10-abb33171048d\', \'multiverseId\': 81271}, \'multiverseid\': 81271}, {\'name\': \'霊気への折り込み\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。そうした場合、その呪文のコントローラーは自分の手札にあるクリーチャー・カードを１枚場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'霊気の扉はミラディン中を漂いまわり、生き物を時間も空間も飛び越えて捕まえる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c1fa713-ea6a-4ed1-af6b-7d4d99738c26\', \'multiverseId\': 80611}, \'multiverseid\': 80611}, {\'name\': \'Dobrar em Éter\', \'text\': \'Anula a mágica alvo. Se você o fizer, o controlador daquela mágica pode colocar em jogo um card de criatura de sua própria mão.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os portais de Éter flutuam pela superfície de Mirrodin, dragando criaturas pelo tempo e pelo espaço.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ce6e7ff-b0ed-4b91-ab0e-10ec4268358b\', \'multiverseId\': 81436}, \'multiverseid\': 81436}, {\'name\': \'乙太收束\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。若你如此作，该咒语的操控者可以从其手上将一张生物牌放置进场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'乙太时空通道在秘罗地表面游移，被卷入的生物将在时空之间迷途。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9c6445c-b844-4628-a4e2-961a893d4bc5\', \'multiverseId\': 81601}, \'multiverseid\': 81601}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fangren-Pfadhacker\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Fangren-Pfadhacker angreift, verursachen angreifende Kreaturen bis zum Ende des Zuges Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Fangrenrudel lässt sich leicht verfolgen. Doch zu ihnen aufzuschließen ist tödlich." — Viridischer Späher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18e19a78-e9e7-4023-9fef-1620594f8902\', \'multiverseId\': 80934}, \'multiverseid\': 80934}, {\'name\': \'Abrebrecha fangren\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Abrebrecha fangren ataque, las criaturas atacantes ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Rastrear una manada de fangren es fácil. Alcanzarla es fatal." —Explorador viridiano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4aa1583-628b-4496-a26a-5d88f243c6dd\', \'multiverseId\': 81099}, \'multiverseid\': 81099}, {\'name\': \'Passe-sentier fangren\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Passe-sentier fangren attaque, les créatures attaquantes acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "« Pister des fangrens, c\'est facile. Les rattraper, c\'est fatal. » —Éclaireur viridian", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80769&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75d3eed1-4fd9-4d7c-8f3d-f5512af7dc33\', \'multiverseId\': 80769}, \'multiverseid\': 80769}, {\'name\': \'Apripista Fangren\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Apripista Fangren attacca, le creature attaccanti guadagnano travolgere fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Seguire un branco di fangren è facile. Raggiungerne uno è fatale." —Esploratore viridiano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'674abca4-d10f-4671-9ba6-8f45d8c31f3e\', \'multiverseId\': 81264}, \'multiverseid\': 81264}, {\'name\': \'路を拓くファングレン\', \'text\': \'路を拓くファングレンが攻撃に参加するたび、攻撃クリーチャーはターン終了時までトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'ファングレンの群れを追うのは簡単だ。捕まえることは命にかかわるがね。 ―― ヴィリジアンの斥候\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeec40ca-00db-4e0b-b570-0db6253cdb51\', \'multiverseId\': 80604}, \'multiverseid\': 80604}, {\'name\': \'Fangren Desbravador\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Fangren Desbravador atacar, as criaturas atacantes ganham a habilidade de atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"É fácil rastrear uma matilha de fangrens. Alcançá-la é fatal." —Batedor Viridiano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15f5b756-df81-44d4-b4cb-4da237db110f\', \'multiverseId\': 81429}, \'multiverseid\': 81429}, {\'name\': \'开山方壬\', \'text\': \'每当开山方壬攻击时，进行攻击的生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'「追踪方壬兽群并不难。但连要追上一只都很要命。」 ～暗碧族斥候\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38ae7112-4e82-4ff2-80af-dd40b6f57a58\', \'multiverseId\': 81594}, \'multiverseid\': 81594}]', "[{'name': 'Ferroped', 'text': 'Der Ferroped ist unblockbar.\\nImmer wenn der Ferroped einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du eine Marke von einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl entfernen.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Insekt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80937&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0aca56aa-6fda-4161-b4af-fb9a53a82d6d', 'multiverseId': 80937}, 'multiverseid': 80937}, {'name': 'Ferrópodo', 'text': 'El Ferrópodo es imbloqueable.\\nSiempre que el Ferrópodo haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes remover un contador del permanente objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Insecto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81102&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79def7ca-d052-4676-863a-dd245157ff6e', 'multiverseId': 81102}, 'multiverseid': 81102}, {'name': 'Ferro-pattes', 'text': 'Le Ferro-pattes est imblocable.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Ferro-pattes inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez retirer un marqueur du permanent ciblé.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : insecte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80772&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a89237ae-e37d-4669-922a-a85010a6e6d5', 'multiverseId': 80772}, 'multiverseid': 80772}, {'name': 'Ferropede', 'text': 'Il Ferropede non può essere bloccato.\\nOgniqualvolta il Ferropede infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi rimuovere un segnalino da un permanente bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Insetto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81267&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95f2558e-8fb8-4297-9715-e3035991e5f4', 'multiverseId': 81267}, 'multiverseid': 81267}, {'name': '鉄ムカデ', 'text': '鉄ムカデはブロックされない。\\n鉄ムカデがいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、パーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれの上から、いずれかのカウンターを１個取り除いてもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 昆虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80607&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9bfc9ab-d70f-41ba-ac9f-9722f002b2fa', 'multiverseId': 80607}, 'multiverseid': 80607}, {'name': 'Ferrópede', 'text': 'Ferrópede não pode ser bloqueado.\\nToda vez que Ferrópede causar dano de combate a um jogador, você pode remover um marcador da permanente alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Inseto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81432&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3471955b-d31a-439c-ba54-dfefbafa1663', 'multiverseId': 81432}, 'multiverseid': 81432}, {'name': '钢铁百足虫', 'text': '钢铁百足虫不能被阻挡。\\n每当钢铁百足虫对牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以从目标永久物上移去一个指示物。', 'type': '神器生物～昆虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81597&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03b24779-0da4-4c49-92d5-98f2959d7f3e', 'multiverseId': 81597}, 'multiverseid': 81597}]", '[{\'name\': \'Fleischbepfropfer\', \'text\': \'Wirf eine Artefaktkarte aus deiner Hand ab: Der Fleischbepfropfer erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Necrogen hat anregende Wirkung auf einige Emotionen in den Hirnen der Moriok: Hass, Aggression und vor allem Gier.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80940&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'800de2fb-acac-47cf-bc90-b47aa9a2852f\', \'multiverseId\': 80940}, \'multiverseid\': 80940}, {\'name\': \'Injertacarne\', \'text\': \'Descartar una carta de artefacto de tu mano: El Injertacarne obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Las nieblas necrógenas estimulan ciertos centros emocionales en los cerebros de los móriok: odio, agresión, y especialmente codicia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6904f25-3a31-49f3-ba74-08d913fe2a7e\', \'multiverseId\': 81105}, \'multiverseid\': 81105}, {\'name\': \'Greffeur de chair\', \'text\': "Défaussez-vous d\'une carte d\'artefact de votre main : Le Greffeur de chair gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Les brumes nécrogènes stimulent certains centres émotionnels du cerveau des Morioks : la haine, l\'agressivité et surtout l\'avidité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80775&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c2f20d-e2ec-4bba-96f4-cb8ef326bae9\', \'multiverseId\': 80775}, \'multiverseid\': 80775}, {\'name\': \'Innestacarne\', \'text\': "Scarta una carta artefatto dalla tua mano: L\'Innestacarne prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'I necrogeni accendono alcuni centri emotivi nel cervello dei Moriok: odio, aggressività e soprattutto cupidigia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f43804d9-45e6-4e08-b8d5-309d141a52dc\', \'multiverseId\': 81270}, \'multiverseid\': 81270}, {\'name\': \'肉体を継ぐ者\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札からアーティファクト･カードを１枚捨てる：肉体を継ぐ者は、ターン終了時まで+2/+2の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'屍気はモーリオックの脳の中のある種の感情をたぎらせる。憎悪、乱暴、そして特に強欲を。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ee9646f-6181-49f2-9036-3ba5129c4b58\', \'multiverseId\': 80610}, \'multiverseid\': 80610}, {\'name\': \'Enxerta-carne\', \'text\': \'Descarte um card de artefato de sua mão: Enxerta-carne recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerreiro Humano\', \'flavor\': \'O necrogênio inflama certos centros emocionais dos cérebros dos Murioques: o ódio, a agressividade e, especialmente, a cobiça.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0074c1da-94ab-4cb2-aafd-0968622b1e37\', \'multiverseId\': 81435}, \'multiverseid\': 81435}, {\'name\': \'殖甲军\', \'text\': \'从你手上弃掉一张神器牌：殖甲军得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'化尸瘴气挑拨着莫锐可人脑中的某些情绪中心：仇恨、侵略，特别是贪婪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'323d5537-1f55-4e4a-a773-54f6c9689001\', \'multiverseId\': 81600}, \'multiverseid\': 81600}]', '[{\'name\': \'Früher Frost\', \'text\': \'Tappe bis zu drei Länder deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Unter seinen Nebeln schläft die Erde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80924&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be487b71-b12d-4dcb-b26b-9ec312a979fc\', \'multiverseId\': 80924}, \'multiverseid\': 80924}, {\'name\': \'Escarcha matinal\', \'text\': \'Gira hasta tres tierras objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Bajo su bruma, la tierra duerme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a9f080-5764-4211-b6a2-b64e9e08764b\', \'multiverseId\': 81089}, \'multiverseid\': 81089}, {\'name\': \'Gel précoce\', \'text\': "Engagez jusqu\'à trois terrains ciblés.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'La terre sommeille sous la brume.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80759&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b345d6a-3262-486a-8a4d-90a3641e272d\', \'multiverseId\': 80759}, \'multiverseid\': 80759}, {\'name\': \'Prime Gelate\', \'text\': \'TAPpa fino a tre terre bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Sotto la nebbia, la terra riposa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'986e8a58-081a-464e-b386-5c1d0c4c6bb0\', \'multiverseId\': 81254}, \'multiverseid\': 81254}, {\'name\': \'早霜\', \'text\': \'土地を最大３枚まで対象とし、それらをタップする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'その霧の下で大地は眠る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86331c3b-1678-47a0-b82b-f8c116881005\', \'multiverseId\': 80594}, \'multiverseid\': 80594}, {\'name\': \'Geada Precoce\', \'text\': \'Vire até três terrenos alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Por baixo de suas névoas, a terra dorme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bbbd100-35ad-4bde-9448-13a45d3452dd\', \'multiverseId\': 81419}, \'multiverseid\': 81419}, {\'name\': \'早霜\', \'text\': \'横置至多三个目标地。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'大地在寒雾中沉睡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54ab1d3c-5411-456d-9e58-a58ad23a56b3\', \'multiverseId\': 81584}, \'multiverseid\': 81584}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkenelementar\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden; Eile.\\nOpfere das Funkenelementar am Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Vulshokschamanen beschwören Funkenelementare, um sich Pfade durch undurchdringbares Unterholz zu brennen — oder durch Bergungstrupps der Goblins.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81011&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'109cb246-4621-4704-8ee9-c48ec17abbc1\', \'multiverseId\': 81011}, \'multiverseid\': 81011}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de chispas\', \'text\': \'Arrolla, prisa.\\nAl final del turno, sacrifica el Elemental de chispas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Los chamanes vúlshok invocan a los elementales de chispas para quemar caminos entre los matorrales espesos, o entre los escuadrones de desarme trasgos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bb840cd-cec2-4841-9307-732725a10fdd\', \'multiverseId\': 81176}, \'multiverseid\': 81176}, {\'name\': "Élémental d\'étincelles", \'text\': "Piétinement, célérité\\nÀ la fin du tour, sacrifiez l\'Élémental d\'étincelles.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Les shamanes vulshoks invoquent des élémentaux d\'étincelles pour se frayer un chemin dans la végétation — ou dans une bande de gobelins.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80846&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb49a7f0-edfd-4a55-ae11-e799008b7031\', \'multiverseId\': 80846}, \'multiverseid\': 80846}, {\'name\': \'Elementale Scintillante\', \'text\': "Travolgere, rapidità\\nAlla fine del turno, sacrifica l\'Elementale Scintillante.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Gli sciamani Vulshok evocano gli elementali scintillanti per forgiare nuovi sentieri attraverso il fitto sottobosco . . . o attraverso le squadre di recupero dei goblin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55469f84-5ace-441a-a030-7edf8f67f7e1\', \'multiverseId\': 81341}, \'multiverseid\': 81341}, {\'name\': \'火花の精霊\', \'text\': \'トランプル、速攻\\nターン終了時に、火花の精霊を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'ヴァルショクのシャーマンは、火花の精霊を頑丈な藪の中に道を切り開くために召喚する――時には、ゴブリンの発掘部隊を突破するためにも。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2bc3c34-028e-4408-839f-bd124a965751\', \'multiverseId\': 80681}, \'multiverseid\': 80681}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de Centelhas\', \'text\': \'Atropelar, ímpeto\\nNo final do turno, sacrifique Elemental de Centelhas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Os xamãs Vulshoques invocam elementais de centelhas para abrir trilhas queimando macegas densas — ou esquadrões de salvamento goblins.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ed2bd8b-4894-4c77-9ccc-ed9d05563b0a\', \'multiverseId\': 81506}, \'multiverseid\': 81506}, {\'name\': \'星火元素\', \'text\': \'践踏，敏捷\\n在回合结束时，牺牲星火元素。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'在浓密灌丛间开路时，瓦许克祭师会召唤星火元素；有时也会拿来对付精灵回收小队。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b137266-ad43-4565-8cb1-4d721c4a5a51\', \'multiverseId\': 81671}, \'multiverseid\': 81671}]', "[{'name': 'Fünfseitiges Prisma', 'text': 'Sonneneruption (Diese Karte kommt für jede unterschiedliche Manafarbe, die beim Bezahlen ihrer Kosten verwendet wurde, mit einer Ladungsmarke ins Spiel.)\\nEntferne eine Ladungsmarke vom Fünfseitigen Prisma: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80984&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e740630-b3af-47da-8f8c-6c77f4e99327', 'multiverseId': 80984}, 'multiverseid': 80984}, {'name': 'Prisma pentavalente', 'text': 'Estallido solar (Esto entra en juego con un contador de carga sobre él por cada color de maná usado para pagar su coste.)\\nRemover un contador de carga del Prisma pentavalente: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81149&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a0372645-6f9a-454a-a33b-272a407542f4', 'multiverseId': 81149}, 'multiverseid': 81149}, {'name': 'Pentode prismatique', 'text': 'Solarisation (Cette carte arrive en jeu avec, sur elle, un marqueur « charge » pour chaque couleur de mana utilisée pour payer son coût.)\\nRetirez un marqueur « charge » de la Pentode prismatique : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80819&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb8478a5-a618-4cc9-b54b-36d8c899f502', 'multiverseId': 80819}, 'multiverseid': 80819}, {'name': 'Prisma Pentavalente', 'text': 'Solarizzazione (Questa carta entra in gioco con un segnalino carica per ogni colore di mana usato per pagare il suo costo.)\\nRimuovi un segnalino carica dal Prisma Pentavalente: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81314&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29f49128-574c-40e9-800d-8856bade9dbc', 'multiverseId': 81314}, 'multiverseid': 81314}, {'name': '五元のプリズム', 'text': '烈日 （これのコストのために支払われたマナの色１色につき１個の蓄積カウンターが置かれた状態で場に出る。）\\n五元のプリズムの上から蓄積カウンターを１個取り除く：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80654&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'acc80c66-3c95-49b1-893b-ab43247dd99a', 'multiverseId': 80654}, 'multiverseid': 80654}, {'name': 'Pentaprisma', 'text': 'Facho Solar (Este card entra em jogo com um marcador de carga para cada cor de mana usada para pagar seu custo.)\\nRemova um marcador de carga de Pentaprisma: Adiciona uma mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81479&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84b61539-4b70-4782-a092-b61896635cbf', 'multiverseId': 81479}, 'multiverseid': 81479}, {'name': '五色棱镜', 'text': '辉映（用过几种颜色的法术力来支付其费用，它进场时上面便有几个充电指示物。）\\n从五色棱镜上移去一个充电指示物：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81644&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e16e9cba-6fd0-4151-9ce8-2b7a4448ac4c', 'multiverseId': 81644}, 'multiverseid': 81644}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenübermittler\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte aus deiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist bezeichnend für die Kultur der Vedalken, dass sie menschlichen Boten mehr trauen als ihren eigenen Kameraden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81029&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d0e7a53-16eb-4e92-9582-e37f314a892c\', \'multiverseId\': 81029}, \'multiverseid\': 81029}, {\'name\': \'Mensajero del pensamiento\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Es un hecho de la cultura vedalken que confíen más en los mensajeros humanos que en sus propios camaradas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ffca1d7-e875-4568-9691-81490252868a\', \'multiverseId\': 81194}, \'multiverseid\': 81194}, {\'name\': \'Messager des pensées\', \'text\': "{T} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte de votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Il est révélateur que les vedalkens fassent plus confiance aux messagers humains qu\'à ceux de leur race.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80864&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f0f5e98-c0d6-44cf-821e-c4e624a4d6db\', \'multiverseId\': 80864}, \'multiverseid\': 80864}, {\'name\': \'Messaggero Psichico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Dice molto della cultura vedalken il fatto che si fidino più dei messaggeri umani che dei loro stessi compagni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0a6697c-645b-4b16-8a16-9d406543dcb8\', \'multiverseId\': 81359}, \'multiverseid\': 81359}, {\'name\': \'思考の急使\', \'text\': \'{T}：カードを１枚引き、その後あなたの手札からカードを１枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'ヴィダルケンが自分の同僚よりも人間の使者を信用することからも、彼らの文明の何たるかがわかる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b610947-f15b-4d0f-9340-5583a763de8a\', \'multiverseId\': 80699}, \'multiverseid\': 80699}, {\'name\': \'Mensageiro de Pensamentos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Compre um card e depois descarte um card de sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago Humano\', \'flavor\': \'É fato conhecido na cultura dos vedalkeanos que eles confiam mais em mensageiros humanos do que nos seus próprios camaradas .\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0f17ede-aac2-4829-8558-2d779c09f238\', \'multiverseId\': 81524}, \'multiverseid\': 81524}, {\'name\': \'心念讯使\', \'text\': \'{T}：抓一张牌，然后从你手上弃掉一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'维多肯文化展露出此现象：他们对人类讯使的信任还多于自己同胞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'348d9b0d-3df1-48f7-947b-5f70ee4a4b63\', \'multiverseId\': 81689}, \'multiverseid\': 81689}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefolgsmyr\', \'text\': \'Ist zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments der Gefolgsmyr im Spiel, bringen alle Spieler alle Karten namens Gefolgsmyr aus ihren Friedhöfen ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Myr\', \'flavor\': \'Der Krark-Clan liebt es, sie auseinander zu nehmen, nur um zuzuschauen, wie sie sich gegenseitig wieder zusammensetzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80977&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db2d7528-bf08-4b27-bdc4-0ee22aaffb46\', \'multiverseId\': 80977}, \'multiverseid\': 80977}, {\'name\': \'Servidor myr\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si el Servidor myr está en juego, cada jugador regresa todas las cartas llamadas Servidor myr de su cementerio al juego.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Myr\', \'flavor\': \'El clan Krark disfruta desarmándolos sólo para verlos reconstruirse entre sí.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'106414f4-a7f0-4211-94d0-8a3570b7f22f\', \'multiverseId\': 81142}, \'multiverseid\': 81142}, {\'name\': \'Valet myr\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, si le Valet myr est en jeu, chaque joueur renvoie en jeu, depuis son cimetière, toutes les cartes appelées Valet myr.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : myr\', \'flavor\': \'Le clan Krark ne se lasse pas de les détruire, rien que pour les voir se reconstruire les uns les autres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80812&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50091dfa-6288-49cf-a553-1ab971fe3aeb\', \'multiverseId\': 80812}, \'multiverseid\': 80812}, {\'name\': \'Servitore Myr\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se il Servitore Myr è in gioco, ciascun giocatore rimette in gioco dal proprio cimitero tutte le carte chiamate Servitore Myr.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Myr\', \'flavor\': \'I Krark-Clan si divertono a farli a pezzi solo per guardarli mentre si ricostruiscono a vicenda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35b3e901-0455-4b06-898d-c7a31d8ee95e\', \'multiverseId\': 81307}, \'multiverseid\': 81307}, {\'name\': \'マイアの苦役者\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、マイアの苦役者が場にある場合、各プレイヤーは自分の墓地にあるすべての「マイアの苦役者」という名前のカードを場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — マイア\', \'flavor\': \'クラーク族はこれを引き裂き、それぞれが互いを修復するのを見て喜ぶ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8979d242-9e86-4329-ab68-f28e6fd92f05\', \'multiverseId\': 80647}, \'multiverseid\': 80647}, {\'name\': \'Serviçal Myr\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se Serviçal Myr estiver em jogo, cada jogador devolve todos os cards com o nome de Serviçal Myr de seu próprio cemitério para o jogo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Myr\', \'flavor\': \'O Clã-de-Krark gosta de separá-los só para vê-los se remontando.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88fe9e17-dba3-40de-b70d-add34ee52fe0\', \'multiverseId\': 81472}, \'multiverseid\': 81472}, {\'name\': \'随侍秘耳\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若随侍秘耳在场，则每位牌手将所有名称为随侍秘耳的牌从其坟墓场中移回场上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～秘耳\', \'flavor\': \'喀勒克族喜欢把他们拆散，然后看他们彼此重新组装回来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7ce4100-bfab-4c2d-bfea-52cbfb4ac04c\', \'multiverseId\': 81637}, \'multiverseid\': 81637}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gellender Zorn\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +5/+0 und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Er hat noch ein Kriegsbeil auszugraben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81002&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7c7d429-adfc-4f04-accb-805bc865c1da\', \'multiverseId\': 81002}, \'multiverseid\': 81002}, {\'name\': \'Furia chillona\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +5/+0 y gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Tiene un hacha para moler.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be860965-7b95-4c32-b368-edf401912ede\', \'multiverseId\': 81167}, \'multiverseid\': 81167}, {\'name\': \'Fureur hurlante\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +5/+0 et acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Il prêche pour son saint.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80837&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75566e2f-a83f-4481-8421-cb04edcd222f\', \'multiverseId\': 80837}, \'multiverseid\': 80837}, {\'name\': \'Furia Urlante\', \'text\': \'La creatura bersaglio prende +5/+0 e guadagna rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Ha un\'ascia da affilare.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4baaf5fe-e144-4757-be0a-b0095eef31b4\', \'multiverseId\': 81332}, \'multiverseid\': 81332}, {\'name\': \'泣き叫ぶ憤怒\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで、+5/+0の修整を受けるとともに速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'心に錆びた刃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0724fae6-4a53-4267-96af-14b746083ace\', \'multiverseId\': 80672}, \'multiverseid\': 80672}, {\'name\': \'Fúria Gritante\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +5/+0 e ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Ele usa um machado para moer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a3059e-ef2d-4e8e-bce6-ebd6756ea405\', \'multiverseId\': 81497}, \'multiverseid\': 81497}, {\'name\': \'暴怒狂吼\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+5/+0且获得敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'他这把斧头可得好好打磨了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88af8f9d-f980-4957-801f-7d751d039b84\', \'multiverseId\': 81662}, \'multiverseid\': 81662}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geschenk des Stahlformers\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ausrüstungskarte, zeige die Karte offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Klingen entscheiden selbst, wer sie zückt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81018&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b2ffb3-d05e-4f9c-8734-d09195e2304a\', \'multiverseId\': 81018}, \'multiverseid\': 81018}, {\'name\': \'Regalo del moldea acero\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de equipo, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Algunas hojas buscan sus propios dueños.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62b5bc92-8ebc-4a09-b171-2f607e9d273a\', \'multiverseId\': 81183}, \'multiverseid\': 81183}, {\'name\': \'Don du forge-acier\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'équipement, révélez cette carte et mettez-la dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Certaines lames cherchent leur porteur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80853&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f33bdbab-3951-4bfa-a477-c32aaad38866\', \'multiverseId\': 80853}, \'multiverseid\': 80853}, {\'name\': \'Dono del Plasmametallo\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta Equipaggiamento, rivela quella carta e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Alcune lame prendono di mira chi le brandisce.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7c7d562-64fa-4f63-b995-57b8becee10b\', \'multiverseId\': 81348}, \'multiverseid\': 81348}, {\'name\': \'鋼打ちの贈り物\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから装備品カードを探し、そのカードを公開してあなたの手札に加える。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'持ち主を求める刃もある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b66f397-075d-4346-9fa7-c1b9c4722231\', \'multiverseId\': 80688}, \'multiverseid\': 80688}, {\'name\': \'Presente do Molda-aço\', \'text\': \'Procure em seu grimório por um card de Equipamento, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Algumas lâminas procuram seus próprios empunhadores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79057546-579b-4e76-b894-a5685b671110\', \'multiverseId\': 81513}, \'multiverseid\': 81513}, {\'name\': \'塑铁军之天赋\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻一张武具牌，展示该牌，并置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'有些刀剑就是会认主人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c54f9140-bc95-4529-b8bd-87d8582f80c9\', \'multiverseId\': 81678}, \'multiverseid\': 81678}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geätzte Weissagung\', \'text\': \'Sonneneruption (Diese Karte kommt für jede unterschiedliche Manafarbe, die beim Bezahlen ihrer Kosten verwendet wurde, mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.)\\n{1}, entferne vier +1/+1-Marken von der Geätzten Weissagung: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a3558f6-1aa1-411c-9d70-f46c0c6eec96\', \'multiverseId\': 80931}, \'multiverseid\': 80931}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo grabado\', \'text\': \'Estallido solar (Esto entra en juego con un contador +1/+1 sobre él por cada color de maná usado para pagar su coste.)\\n{1}, remover cuatro contadores +1/+1 del Oráculo grabado: El jugador objetivo roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22291d29-ca2a-4e4d-ab8a-b0293d9748d1\', \'multiverseId\': 81096}, \'multiverseid\': 81096}, {\'name\': \'Oracle gravé\', \'text\': "Solarisation (Cette carte arrive en jeu avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1 pour chaque couleur de mana utilisée pour payer son coût.)\\n{1}, Retirez quatre marqueurs +1/+1 de l\'Oracle gravé : Le joueur ciblé pioche trois cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80766&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b080760-3da3-4479-9f39-b72e6528cbe5\', \'multiverseId\': 80766}, \'multiverseid\': 80766}, {\'name\': \'Oracolo Inciso\', \'text\': "Solarizzazione (Questa carta entra in gioco con un segnalino +1/+1 per ogni colore di mana usato per pagare il suo costo.)\\n{1}, Rimuovi quattro segnalini +1/+1 dall\'Oracolo Inciso: Il giocatore bersaglio pesca tre carte.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dc6d590-5f56-4997-9949-33be9fa5ce3c\', \'multiverseId\': 81261}, \'multiverseid\': 81261}, {\'name\': \'刻まれた巫女\', \'text\': \'烈日 （これのコストのために支払われたマナの色１色につき１個の+1/+1カウンターが置かれた状態で場に出る。）\\n{1}, 刻まれた巫女の上から+1/+1カウンターを４個取り除く：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを３枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd0acbd9-f5ed-4c54-91a4-bf42c8a698c0\', \'multiverseId\': 80601}, \'multiverseid\': 80601}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo Daguerreotipado\', \'text\': \'Facho Solar (Este card entra em jogo com um marcador +1/+1 para cada cor de mana usada para pagar seu custo.)\\n{1}, Remova quatro marcadores +1/+1 de Oráculo Daguerreotipado: O jogador alvo compra três cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ce202ac-e87d-4d1b-bb08-a6b768032507\', \'multiverseId\': 81426}, \'multiverseid\': 81426}, {\'name\': \'蚀刻先知\', \'text\': \'辉映（用过几种颜色的法术力来支付其费用，它进场时上面便有几个+1/+1指示物。）\\n{1}，从蚀刻先知上移去四个+1/+1指示物：目标牌手抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fee7c76-d0b7-4486-ac01-246d703a8de6\', \'multiverseId\': 81591}, \'multiverseid\': 81591}]', "[{'name': 'Goblinkanone', 'text': '{2}: Die Goblinkanone fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Opfere die Goblinkanone.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Goblinkanoniere sind nicht für ihre Zielgenauigkeit bekannt, sondern eher für ihr Geschick beim Suchen von Deckung.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80945&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '333f823f-637d-45c6-9ec5-6823547df9ed', 'multiverseId': 80945}, 'multiverseid': 80945}, {'name': 'Cañón trasgo', 'text': '{2}: El Cañón trasgo hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo. Sacrifica el Cañón trasgo.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Las tripulaciones de cañones trasgo no son conocidas por su puntería, sino por su habilidad para ponerse a cubierto.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81110&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '67bcda5b-f776-48be-b930-3ceeff19bfc3', 'multiverseId': 81110}, 'multiverseid': 81110}, {'name': 'Canon gobelin', 'text': '{2} : Le Canon gobelin inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur. Sacrifiez le Canon gobelin.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'Les canonniers gobelins savent surtout se mettre aux abris.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80780&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7a413dd-feeb-42c6-b4f6-321178670887', 'multiverseId': 80780}, 'multiverseid': 80780}, {'name': 'Cannone Goblin', 'text': '{2}: Il Cannone Goblin infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio. Sacrifica il Cannone Goblin.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': 'I cannonieri goblin sono famosi non tanto per la loro mira, quanto per la loro abilità nel gettarsi al riparo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81275&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bc2dd37-3e7c-4468-afa4-f29bece184ec', 'multiverseId': 81275}, 'multiverseid': 81275}, {'name': 'ゴブリンの大砲', 'text': '{2}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。ゴブリンの大砲はそれに１点のダメージを与える。ゴブリンの大砲を生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'ゴブリンの砲手は狙いの正確さで有名なんじゃなく、援護のために飛び込んで来ることで有名だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80615&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '591e5cd6-9e0e-4467-8d43-7f2916856ad1', 'multiverseId': 80615}, 'multiverseid': 80615}, {'name': 'Canhão dos Goblins', 'text': '{2}: Canhão dos Goblins causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo. Sacrifique Canhão dos Goblins.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': 'As equipes de goblins canhoneiros não são conhecidas por sua mira, mas por sua capacidade de encontrar abrigo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81440&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05ca6dd2-bc4b-4da9-9733-18ebf951b422', 'multiverseId': 81440}, 'multiverseid': 81440}, {'name': '精灵大炮', 'text': '{2}：精灵大炮对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。牺牲精灵大炮。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '精灵炮兵最出名之处，并不是目标瞄得好，而是掩护找得快。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81605&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd695fcf6-42db-4a10-9f8f-dbddcf4f7b63', 'multiverseId': 81605}, 'multiverseid': 81605}]", "[{'name': 'Goblinraufbold', 'text': 'Erstschlag\\nDer Goblinraufbold kann nicht ausgerüstet werden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger', 'flavor': 'Vielleicht verachtet er Technologie. Vielleicht liebt er die Natur. Vielleicht kennt er auch nur den Unterschied nicht.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80944&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5662e784-e881-412a-912a-9997ecbcd702', 'multiverseId': 80944}, 'multiverseid': 80944}, {'name': 'Pendenciero trasgo', 'text': 'Daña primero.\\nEl Pendenciero trasgo no puede ser equipado.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo', 'flavor': 'Quizás desprecia la tecnología. Quizás aprecia la naturaleza. Quizás no conoce la diferencia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81109&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb7fceb0-d421-4142-88f9-03b4ff0a399d', 'multiverseId': 81109}, 'multiverseid': 81109}, {'name': 'Bagarreur gobelin', 'text': 'Initiative\\nLe Bagarreur gobelin ne peut pas être équipé.', 'type': 'Créature : gobelin et guerrier', 'flavor': 'Peut-être déteste-t-il la technologie ? Peut-être apprécie-t-il la nature ?... Peut-être est-il simplement stupide ?', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80779&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e1aa343-c0ca-4c42-8c57-2c69e11388db', 'multiverseId': 80779}, 'multiverseid': 80779}, {'name': 'Lottatore Goblin', 'text': 'Attacco improvviso\\nIl Lottatore Goblin non può essere equipaggiato.', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin', 'flavor': 'Forse evita la tecnologia. Forse ama la natura. Forse non conosce la differenza.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81274&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7ed83e8-8eb3-4a91-b4f8-6d1f4db8f025', 'multiverseId': 81274}, 'multiverseid': 81274}, {'name': 'ゴブリンの喧嘩屋', 'text': '先制攻撃\\nゴブリンの喧嘩屋は装備できない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士', 'flavor': '彼は技術が嫌いで、自然に感謝しているのだろう。もっとも、彼にはその違いなんかわからないだろう。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80614&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8e12f72-d122-4280-8dd7-b3c3366c572a', 'multiverseId': 80614}, 'multiverseid': 80614}, {'name': 'Rufião Goblin', 'text': 'Iniciativa\\nRufião Goblin não pode ser equipado.', 'type': 'Criatura — Goblin Guerreiro', 'flavor': 'Talvez ele evite a tecnologia. Talvez aprecie a natureza. Talvez não saiba a diferença.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81439&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fc1133b-fb77-4fd4-90da-f7fe409e28a0', 'multiverseId': 81439}, 'multiverseid': 81439}, {'name': '精灵喧哗兵', 'text': '先攻\\n精灵喧哗兵不能佩带武具。', 'type': '生物～精灵／战士', 'flavor': '或许他讨厌科技产物。或许他喜爱自然。也或许他根本分不清其间差异。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81604&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '098ba4c8-335e-487d-bab0-feb52a4ca052', 'multiverseId': 81604}, 'multiverseid': 81604}]", '[{\'name\': \'Granulieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Artefakte, die kein Land sind und umgewandelte Manakosten von 4 oder weniger haben.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt nicht soooo viele Möglichkeiten, eine gute Stahlwaffe zu zerstören, aber irgendwie fällt Goblins immer etwas Neues ein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80947&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43ea768a-e9c8-42fc-8e00-64f5f18a5ace\', \'multiverseId\': 80947}, \'multiverseid\': 80947}, {\'name\': \'Granular\', \'text\': \'Destruye cada artefacto que no sea tierra con coste de maná convertido de 4 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'No hay tantas maneras de destruir un arma de acero sólido, pero de algún modo los trasgos siguen encontrando nuevas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a80af17-551f-411f-ba52-ce94fcabf549\', \'multiverseId\': 81112}, \'multiverseid\': 81112}, {\'name\': \'Granuler\', \'text\': \'Détruisez chaque artefact non-terrain dont le coût converti de mana est de 4 ou moins.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'existe pas tant de façons de détruire une arme en acier, mais les gobelins parviennent toujours à en trouver de nouvelles.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80782&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'127edbb9-0c31-46b7-8553-52ab782a56f7\', \'multiverseId\': 80782}, \'multiverseid\': 80782}, {\'name\': \'Sgretolare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi ogni artefatto non terra con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Non ci sono così tanti modi per distruggere una solida arma d\'acciaio, eppure i goblin riescono sempre a trovarne di nuovi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b5288d8-07ee-4e1d-a1e9-658a636e0d01\', \'multiverseId\': 81277}, \'multiverseid\': 81277}, {\'name\': \'粒化\', \'text\': \'点数で見たマナ・コストが４以下の、土地でない各アーティファクトを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'硬い鋼の武器を壊す方法はそう多くはないのだが、ゴブリンはとにかく新しい方法を見つけ続けている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adb14ca7-cb74-42c8-b376-07cfc643559b\', \'multiverseId\': 80617}, \'multiverseid\': 80617}, {\'name\': \'Granular\', \'text\': \'Destrói cada artefato que não seja um terreno com custo de mana convertido menor ou igual a 4.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Não há tantas maneiras de se destruir uma arma sólida de aço, mas de alguma forma os goblins continuam encontrando novos jeitos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a08405f8-92f1-445e-a627-5e9934e1a095\', \'multiverseId\': 81442}, \'multiverseid\': 81442}, {\'name\': \'化为碎粒\', \'text\': \'消灭所有非地，且总法术力费用等于或小于4的神器。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'虽然毁掉精钢武器的方法不是那么多，但精灵就是竭尽所能要找出新的法子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3f9076f-7a65-4651-891b-4a992da0b6fd\', \'multiverseId\': 81607}, \'multiverseid\': 81607}]', "[{'name': 'Grotesker Nim', 'text': 'Der Groteske Nim erhält +1/+0 für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zombie', 'flavor': 'In den wirbelnden Nebeln könntest du direkt in einen hineinlaufen und es erst merken, wenn seine Zähne sich in deine Kehle bohren.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80980&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f8aefbd-daea-46a7-9487-ee29f9324194', 'multiverseId': 80980}, 'multiverseid': 80980}, {'name': 'Nim grotesco', 'text': 'El Nim grotesco obtiene +1/+0 por cada artefacto que controles.', 'type': 'Criatura — Zombie', 'flavor': 'En las nieblas arremolinadas podrías toparte con uno sin darte cuenta hasta que sus dientes estén en tu garganta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81145&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6215d78d-95be-46b6-b2f2-46a400182adb', 'multiverseId': 81145}, 'multiverseid': 81145}, {'name': 'Nim grotesque', 'text': 'Le Nim grotesque gagne +1/+0 pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Créature : zombie', 'flavor': 'Perdu dans les brumes, ses crocs pourraient vous percer la gorge avant que vous ne puissiez le voir.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80815&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39379826-4622-43f3-90a8-7f59d8b0089c', 'multiverseId': 80815}, 'multiverseid': 80815}, {'name': 'Nim Grottesco', 'text': 'Il Nim Grottesco prende +1/+0 per ogni artefatto che controlli.', 'type': 'Creatura — Zombie', 'flavor': 'Tra le nebbie turbinanti, puoi andare a sbattere contro uno di loro senza neppure accorgertene, almeno finché i suoi denti non si serrano sulla tua gola.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81310&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '527bfef8-da6d-4b15-9495-f01491ddc752', 'multiverseId': 81310}, 'multiverseid': 81310}, {'name': '屍賊の怪魔', 'text': '屍賊の怪魔は、あなたがコントロールするアーティファクト１つにつき+1/+0の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': '渦巻く霧の中、誰かに向かって歩いていけば、正体がわかるときには喉元に歯が食い込んでいる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80650&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c506fbb5-285b-4f72-bc26-512fadd322a1', 'multiverseId': 80650}, 'multiverseid': 80650}, {'name': 'Nim Grotesco', 'text': 'Nim Grotesco recebe +1/+0 para cada artefato que você controla.', 'type': 'Criatura — Zumbi', 'flavor': 'Nas névoas rodopiantes, você poderia dar de cara com um e só perceber quando ele estivesse com os dentes cravados na sua garganta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81475&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6c9522c-0109-4d50-90fe-979deed7194b', 'multiverseId': 81475}, 'multiverseid': 81475}, {'name': '怪诞泞族', 'text': '你每操控一个神器，怪诞泞族便得+1/+0。', 'type': '生物～灵俑', 'flavor': '在涡卷迷雾中，或许直到喉头被它的牙齿撕裂，你才看得见它。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81640&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4269715a-ef8e-4fc0-a04e-8b40d29965ad', 'multiverseId': 81640}, 'multiverseid': 81640}]", '[{\'name\': \'Handschrift der Sonnen\', \'text\': \'Du kannst {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} bezahlen, anstatt die Manakosten von Zaubersprüchen, die du spielst, zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe alles im Griff. Jeder Wunschtraum, jeder große Plan, jede Seele, jede Angst. Alles fließt durch mich und geht von mir aus." — Memnarch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80939&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf3e24e3-5530-4c7a-bac0-bd82c5645fb5\', \'multiverseId\': 80939}, \'multiverseid\': 80939}, {\'name\': \'Puño de los soles\', \'text\': \'Puedes pagar {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} en lugar de pagar el coste de maná de los hechizos que juegues.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Está todo bajo mi control. Cada sueño trivial, cada gran proyecto, cada alma, cada temor. Todo fluye de mí y a través de mí." —Memnarch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f146ef97-2033-4f76-a288-fb37824b276e\', \'multiverseId\': 81104}, \'multiverseid\': 81104}, {\'name\': \'Poigne des soleils\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez payer {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} à la place du coût de mana des sorts que vous jouez.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Tout est à ma portée. Chaque rêve, chaque conspiration, chaque âme, chaque peur. Je suis au centre de tout ce maelström. » —Memnarch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80774&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7124cc06-4e7d-4380-96f8-9c6f512637f5\', \'multiverseId\': 80774}, \'multiverseid\': 80774}, {\'name\': \'Pugno dei Soli\', \'text\': \'Puoi spendere {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} invece di pagare il costo di mana per le magie che giochi.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"È tutto sotto il mio controllo. Ogni sogno futile, ogni piano grandioso, ogni anima, ogni paura. Tutto scorre attraverso me e tutto deriva da me." —Memnarch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9cdd114-1e37-4c5e-9e08-4129d6a57e43\', \'multiverseId\': 81269}, \'multiverseid\': 81269}, {\'name\': \'太陽の拳\', \'text\': \'あなたは、あなたがプレイする呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}を支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それはすべて私の手の中にある。つまらぬ夢も、壮大な計画も、魂も、恐れもだ。すべては私から生まれ、私の中を抜けていくのだ。 ―― メムナーク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff5ce1d2-ff60-4bd8-a5ca-c824c1ea1077\', \'multiverseId\': 80609}, \'multiverseid\': 80609}, {\'name\': \'Punho dos Sóis\', \'text\': \'Você pode pagar {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} em vez de pagar o custo de mana das mágicas que jogar.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Tudo está sob o meu controle. Cada sonho insignificante, cada grande plano, cada alma, cada medo. Tudo flui através de mim e a partir de mim." —Memnarca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17d7e2f2-6f53-4ee9-9dc7-4f26b73c83a9\', \'multiverseId\': 81434}, \'multiverseid\': 81434}, {\'name\': \'五阳护手\', \'text\': \'你可支付{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}，而不支付你所使用之咒语的法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「一切都在我掌握中。每场美梦、每段计画、每个灵魂、每丝恐惧，全在我意识内外流动。」 ～蒙纳珂\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adbe9d03-5551-4b26-99cb-8594bd78b086\', \'multiverseId\': 81599}, \'multiverseid\': 81599}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hart bleiben\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nHellsicht 2 (Betrachte die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek. Lege eine beliebige Anzahl davon in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek und den Rest oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81016&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'549db787-24d4-4d1e-9e78-c6fcdbfe7bf8\', \'multiverseId\': 81016}, \'multiverseid\': 81016}, {\'name\': \'Resistir firme\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\\nAdivinar 2 (Mira las dos primeras cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca. Pon cualquier número de ellas en la parte inferior de tu biblioteca y el resto, en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdb30079-a2e6-4ae0-b55a-b280a0f6c38c\', \'multiverseId\': 81181}, \'multiverseid\': 81181}, {\'name\': \'De pied ferme\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nRegard 2 (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste, au-dessus, dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80851&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb854ffb-958f-4f44-9996-98fe631b3aad\', \'multiverseId\': 80851}, \'multiverseid\': 80851}, {\'name\': \'Resistere\', \'text\': "La creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\\nProfetizzare 2 (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Metti un qualsiasi numero di esse in fondo al tuo grimorio e le rimanenti in cima a esso nell\'ordine che preferisci.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d58c6cb7-b109-465a-8e95-93ce34a458c1\', \'multiverseId\': 81346}, \'multiverseid\': 81346}, {\'name\': \'断固\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで+1/+1の修整を受ける。\\n占術 ２ （あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを見る。そのうち望む枚数をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを一番上に、望む順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e43abd8-f1da-4c02-b40e-a68fab31215e\', \'multiverseId\': 80686}, \'multiverseid\': 80686}, {\'name\': \'Permanecer Firme\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\\nVidência 2 (Olhe os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque qualquer número deles no fundo de seu grimório e o restante no topo em qualquer ordem.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9355374b-f333-459c-a752-e0420ffb4b34\', \'multiverseId\': 81511}, \'multiverseid\': 81511}, {\'name\': \'坚定不移\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\\n占卜2（检视你牌库顶的两张牌。将其中任意数量的牌置于你牌库底，其余则置于你牌库顶；你决定牌的顺序。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dad26c6d-ca0a-4937-8cad-61fe65d52520\', \'multiverseId\': 81676}, \'multiverseid\': 81676}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heimzahlen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen, die dir in diesem Zug Schaden zugefügt haben.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Auriok lernten Beharrlichkeit von ihren Vorvätern. Doch erst die Leoniden lehrten sie Gerechtigkeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80995&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44d87d0c-2a67-4e6a-ad83-0e83f024a5f0\', \'multiverseId\': 80995}, \'multiverseid\': 80995}, {\'name\': \'Tomar represalias\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas que te hicieron daño este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los áuriok aprendieron perseverancia de sus antepasados. Aprendieron justicia de los leoninos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1630cb8f-6673-4cb2-b966-e842299f741e\', \'multiverseId\': 81160}, \'multiverseid\': 81160}, {\'name\': \'Talion\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures qui vous ont infligé des blessures ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les Aurioks ont appris de leurs ancêtres la persévérance. C\'est des léonins qu\'ils ont appris la justice.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80830&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb928168-8639-4610-bd22-f3df1cb7f899\', \'multiverseId\': 80830}, \'multiverseid\': 80830}, {\'name\': \'Rivalersi\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature che ti hanno inflitto danno in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli Auriok hanno imparato la perseveranza dai propri progenitori. E hanno imparato la giustizia dai leonid.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73393023-4513-46e9-824f-d35600713581\', \'multiverseId\': 81325}, \'multiverseid\': 81325}, {\'name\': \'応酬\', \'text\': \'このターンあなたにダメージを与えたすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'オーリオックは忍耐を先祖から学び、正義はレオニンから学んだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6de17dfa-6fa4-465a-a2a9-3619223d3d1f\', \'multiverseId\': 80665}, \'multiverseid\': 80665}, {\'name\': \'Retaliar\', \'text\': \'Destrói todas as criaturas que causaram dano a você neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os Aurioques aprenderam a perseverar com os seus antepassados. Eles aprenderam justiça com os leoninos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17d6441c-e9e5-4936-83a2-6b9b16d1a36d\', \'multiverseId\': 81490}, \'multiverseid\': 81490}, {\'name\': \'彻底报复\', \'text\': \'消灭所有曾在本回合中对你造成伤害的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'欧瑞克人以先祖作坚持不懈的榜样，并以狮族作伸张正义的榜样。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3be64a57-9eec-446a-afcf-f8e76cba839c\', \'multiverseId\': 81655}, \'multiverseid\': 81655}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herablassen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, falls sein Beherrscher nicht {X} bezahlt.\\nHellsicht 2 (Betrachte die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek. Lege eine beliebige Anzahl davon in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek und den Rest oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=80912&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f574038-5f38-4107-9977-dbfd65149c86\', \'multiverseId\': 80912}, \'multiverseid\': 80912}, {\'name\': \'Condescender\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {X}.\\nAdivinar 2 (Mira las dos primeras cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca. Pon cualquier número de ellas en la parte inferior de tu biblioteca y el resto, en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=81077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bab21b59-7447-4ad1-b3ff-3ddd3e25df9c\', \'multiverseId\': 81077}, \'multiverseid\': 81077}, {\'name\': \'Condescendance\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez le sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paye {X}.\\nRegard 2 (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste, au-dessus, dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?mul